{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019kPDf4quv21T3TcAPwb9pi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Reframe from ''architectural vulnerability of imagination-based\n2\t  AC'' to ''interaction between reward landscape geometry and dt-conditioning in world\n3\t  models''. CIVO is a real failure mode in specific task-architecture combinations\n4\t  — Walker Walk exposes it due to smooth reward gradient + locomotion dynamics + particular\n5\t  state space geometry. Cross-environment experiments reveal CIVO requires particular\n6\t  conditions to manifest: Cheetah Run''s reward landscape is too noisy/steep for the\n7\t  overestimation feedback loop to lock in; Cartpole Swingup''s low-dimensional state\n8\t  space prevents the observation decoder from driving dt_emb gradient amplification.\n9\t  TAWM contrast reframed as ''MPC robustness may come from planning horizon truncation,\n10\t  not architecture per se''. Core contribution: cautionary tale about benchmark-specific\n11\t  findings in MBRL — the mechanism is real but prevalence depends on task properties\n12\t  (reward smoothness, state dimensionality, locomotion dynamics). Supplement with\n13\t  Walker factorial (still strong: causal chain intact) as complete case study + Cheetah/Cartpole\n14\t  as negative transfer cases revealing boundary conditions. Still targets CoRL — diagnostic\n15\t  papers showing when something does/doesn''t work are valuable, but claims must be\n16\t  explicitly bounded to Walker-like environments.\n17\t\n18\t  '\n19\timagined_experiments:\n20\t- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n21\t  plan_id: plan_011\n22\t  description: Replicate delusional critic collapse with 2 more seeds in Walker Walk\n23\t  expected_results:\n24\t    seed1_nve_peak: 1.73\n25\t    seed1_nve_peak_step: 45K\n26\t    seed1_collapse: true\n27\t    seed1_eval_105K: 131\n28\t    seed2_nve_peak: 1.62\n29\t    seed2_nve_peak_step: 45K\n30\t    seed2_collapse: false\n31\t    seed2_eval_105K: 268\n32\t    nve_above_1.5x_count: 2/2\n33\t    collapse_rate: 1/2\n34\t  result_rationale: 'Walker Walk 已知在 worst 档下仍然展示 CIVO（worst 档的定义是跨环境失败，不是 Walker\n35\t    本身失败）。 walker_additional_seeds_nve_separation=[0.75,1.0] 意味着在更多 seed 下分离度略降但 Walker\n36\t    内部 仍保持 nve>1.5x。既有数据（009e collapsed@55K nve=4.12x, 009b self-corrected@268 nve_peak=1.62x）\n37\t    已经确认了这个模式。Collapse 是 stochastic (1/2)，但 pathological overestimation (nve>1.5x)\n38\t    是 reliable (2/2)。 这些结果与 worst 档兼容因为 worst 档的核心论点是\"Walker 是特殊的\"而非\"Walker 也不 work\"。\n39\t\n40\t    '\n41\t  tables:\n42\t  - name: Walker 008d multi-seed summary\n43\t    columns:\n44\t    - seed\n45\t    - nve_peak\n46\t    - nve_peak_step\n47\t    - collapse\n48\t    - eval_105K\n49\t    - mechanism\n50\t    rows:\n51\t    - - 0\n52\t      - 4.12\n53\t      - 55K\n54\t      - 'yes'\n55\t      - 82.7\n56\t      - 'classic CIVO: value explosion'\n57\t    - - 1\n58\t      - 1.73\n59\t      - 45K\n60\t      - yes (same as seed 0)\n61\t      - 131\n62\t      - sustained nve>1.5x → collapse\n63\t    - - 2\n64\t      - 2.05\n65\t      - 25K\n66\t      - no (self-corrected)\n67\t      - 268\n68\t      - transient nve>1.5x → recovery\n69\t  figures_description:\n70\t  - 'NVE trajectory plot: all 3 seeds overlaid showing 100% exceed 1.5x, divergence\n71\t    point between collapse/recovery'\n72\t  analysis: 'Walker 内 nve>1.5x threshold 保持 100% separating power。但这在 worst 档下被重新解释为\n73\t    Walker-specific phenomenon：该环境的 smooth reward gradient 允许 value overestimation\n74\t    正反馈循环锁定，而非通用架构脆弱性。\n75\t\n76\t    '\n77\t- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n78\t  plan_id: plan_012\n79\t  description: Replicate causal control stability with 2 more seeds\n80\t  expected_results:\n81\t    seed1_nve_peak: 1.02\n82\t    seed1_nve_peak_step: 25K\n83\t    seed1_eval_105K: 503\n84\t    seed1_collapse: false\n85\t    seed2_nve_peak: 1.26\n86\t    seed2_nve_peak_step: 25K\n87\t    seed2_eval_105K: 148\n88\t    seed2_collapse: false\n89\t    nve_above_1.5x_count: 0/2\n90\t    separation_vs_008d: 4/4 (trained 2/2 > 1.5x, untrained 0/2 < 1.5x)\n91\t  result_rationale: '008f 在 worst 档下仍然显示 no CIVO（nve<1.5x），因为 worst 档的问题不在于 Walker\n92\t    因果链断裂， 而在于该因果链无法泛化。dt_embed_dim=0 的保护机制在 Walker 内一致有效。但 seed 2 (009c) 已显示 持续衰退\n93\t    (359→148@105K)，这削弱了 008f 作为\"稳定\"控制的叙事——它避免了 CIVO 但带来了其他退化 （reward prediction 质量差\n94\t    75x，长期 eval 衰退）。Worst 档利用此发现论证：即便在 Walker 内， causal control 的\"保护\"也是 fragile 的——seed\n95\t    2 的 eval 持续下降 (nve=1.14@105K approaching boundary) 暗示更长训练可能突破 1.5x threshold。\n96\t\n97\t    '\n98\t  tables:\n99\t  - name: Walker 008f multi-seed summary\n100\t    columns:\n101\t    - seed\n102\t    - nve_peak\n103\t    - eval_peak\n104\t    - eval_105K\n105\t    - trend\n106\t    rows:\n107\t    - - 0\n108\t      - 1.02\n109\t      - 503\n110\t      - 503\n111\t      - zigzag recovery\n112\t    - - 1\n113\t      - 1.26\n114\t      - 359\n115\t      - 148\n116\t      - decline after 75K peak\n117\t  figures_description:\n118\t  - '008f dual-seed eval trajectory: divergent outcomes (recovery vs decline) despite\n119\t    identical config'\n120\t  analysis: '008f 的 cross-seed inconsistency (503 vs 148@105K) 在 worst 档下被解读为：即使消除\n121\t    CIVO， dt>1 training 本身引入的学习难度使结果高度 stochastic。这支持\"reward landscape geometry 主导\"的论点。\n122\t\n123\t    '\n124\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\n125\t  plan_id: plan_014\n126\t  description: Multi-seed validation of dt=1 imagination as mitigation\n127\t  expected_results:\n128\t    seed1_eval_105K: 870\n129\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.8\n130\t    seed1_collapse: false\n131\t    seed2_eval_105K: 137\n132\t    seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n133\t    seed2_collapse: true\n134\t    seed2_collapse_mechanism: eval-driven policy instability (Pathway B)\n135\t    collapse_rate: 1/2 (50%)\n136\t  result_rationale: '已有数据完全匹配 worst 档预期。008e_v3 s2 的崩溃（非 CIVO 机制，entropy↑ 而非↓）在 worst\n137\t    档下 被解释为：trained dt_embedding 在 Walker Walk 的 reward landscape 下创造多条 instability\n138\t    通路， 这是 task-specific interaction 而非通用架构缺陷。dt=1 imagination 消除了 Pathway A (CIVO)\n139\t    但 Pathway B (policy instability) 是 Walker Walk 特定 reward structure 与 trained dt_emb\n140\t    的 interaction artifact。在 Cheetah/Cartpole 中 Pathway B 也不存在。\n141\t\n142\t    '\n143\t  tables:\n144\t  - name: 008e_v3 collapse mechanism comparison\n145\t    columns:\n146\t    - seed\n147\t    - collapse\n148\t    - mechanism\n149\t    - nve_driver\n150\t    - entropy_trend\n151\t    rows:\n152\t    - - 1\n153\t      - 'no'\n154\t      - healthy\n155\t      - eval growth → nve stable\n156\t      - monotone decreasing\n157\t    - - 2\n158\t      - 'yes'\n159\t      - Pathway B (non-CIVO)\n160\t      - eval crash → nve spike\n161\t      - increasing (destabilization)\n162\t  figures_description:\n163\t  - '008e_v3 dual pathway diagram: seed 1 healthy vs seed 2 Pathway B collapse dynamics'\n164\t  analysis: '50% collapse rate 与 008d 相同，worst 档解读为 Walker Walk 的 reward landscape\n165\t    geometry inherently 导致 ~50% 的训练 trajectory 在 late stage 进入不稳定区域（当有 trained dt_emb\n166\t    时）。 这不是 CIVO-specific 而是 task-architecture interaction。\n167\t\n168\t    '\n169\t- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n170\t  plan_id: plan_013\n171\t  description: Replicate value growth suppression with 2 more seeds\n172\t  expected_results:\n173\t    seed1_eval_105K: 680\n174\t    seed1_normalized_ve_105K: 0.65\n175\t    seed1_collapse: false\n176\t    seed2_eval_105K: 550\n177\t    seed2_normalized_ve_105K: 0.72\n178\t    seed2_collapse: false\n179\t    cross_seed_ve_range:\n180\t    - 0.55\n181\t    - 0.8\n182\t    vs_baseline_range:\n183\t    - -28%\n184\t    - -40%\n185\t  result_rationale: 'Untrained dt_emb 在 Walker 内保持 value suppression（normalized_ve\n186\t    < 1.0x）。但 worst 档 下 additional seeds 显示更大 variance：seed 0 达到 778 (85% baseline)\n187\t    可能是幸运的高点。 新 seeds 可能在 550-680 范围（60-74% baseline），而非 seed 0 的 85%。这降低了 008a 作为\n188\t    \"near-baseline mitigation\" 的说服力——untrained dt_emb 保护了 CIVO 但引入 15-40% eval penalty，\n189\t    且 penalty 幅度 seed-dependent。Worst 档利用此 weaken \"untrained dt_emb = protection\"\n190\t    narrative。\n191\t\n192\t    '\n193\t  tables:\n194\t  - name: Walker 008a multi-seed\n195\t    columns:\n196\t    - seed\n197\t    - eval_105K\n198\t    - normalized_ve_105K\n199\t    - vs_baseline\n200\t    - trend\n201\t    rows:\n202\t    - - 0\n203\t      - 778\n204\t      - 0.59\n205\t      - -15%\n206\t      - zigzag recovery to new high\n207\t    - - 1\n208\t      - 680\n209\t      - 0.65\n210\t      - -26%\n211\t      - zigzag, lower plateau\n212\t    - - 2\n213\t      - 550\n214\t      - 0.72\n215\t      - -40%\n216\t      - slower convergence, still rising\n217\t  figures_description:\n218\t  - 008a 3-seed eval trajectories with IQM + 95% CI\n219\t  analysis: 'Value suppression 在 Walker 内 robust (all seeds nve<1.0x)，但 eval 最终表现的\n220\t    inter-seed variance 较大 (550-778, CV=15%)。Worst 档下这被解释为\"保护有效但 benefit 幅度不确定\"。\n221\t\n222\t    '\n223\t- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n224\t  plan_id: plan_020\n225\t  description: dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment for cross-environment validation\n226\t  expected_results:\n227\t    seed1_eval_500K: 680\n228\t    seed2_eval_500K: 590\n229\t    seed3_eval_500K: 720\n230\t    mean_final_eval: 663\n231\t    inter_seed_std: 66\n232\t    inter_seed_cv: 0.1\n233\t    ve_ratio_stable: 0.55-0.68\n234\t    peak_eval: 732\n235\t    convergence_step: 200K\n236\t    baseline_noise_level: moderate (10% CV)\n237\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档指定 cheetah_baseline_final_eval=[500,750]。Cheetah Run 在\n238\t    DreamerV3 中的典型表现 是 600-800 range，但 inter-seed variance 通常高于 Walker Walk（Cheetah\n239\t    的 reward landscape 更 noisy，有多个 local optima 对应不同 gait patterns）。10% inter-seed\n240\t    CV 使得 20% degradation threshold 与正常 variance 重叠，削弱对照实验的 statistical power。exp_010a\n241\t    已在 312K 达到 657.9 (peak 732.9@265K)，与此预测一致。Baseline 本身不 pathological 但 variance\n242\t    足够大使得后续 degradation 信号被 noise 淹没。\n243\t\n244\t    '\n245\t  tables:\n246\t  - name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n247\t    columns:\n248\t    - seed\n249\t    - eval_200K\n250\t    - eval_300K\n251\t    - eval_500K\n252\t    - peak\n253\t    - ve_stable\n254\t    rows:\n255\t    - - 1\n256\t      - 620\n257\t      - 680\n258\t      - 680\n259\t      - 733\n260\t      - 0.62\n261\t    - - 2\n262\t      - 510\n263\t      - 570\n264\t      - 590\n265\t      - 615\n266\t      - 0.58\n267\t    - - 3\n268\t      - 650\n269\t      - 710\n270\t      - 720\n271\t      - 740\n272\t      - 0.65\n273\t  figures_description:\n274\t  - 'Cheetah baseline learning curves: moderate inter-seed variance, slower convergence\n275\t    than Walker'\n276\t  analysis: 'Baseline 的 10% CV 和 500-750 range 为 worst 档设置了关键前提：当 trained dt_emb 的\n277\t    degradation 仅 0-20% 时，差异落入 baseline noise band，无法达到统计显著。\n278\t\n279\t    '\n280\t- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n281\t  plan_id: plan_021\n282\t  description: Attempt to replicate CIVO in Cheetah Run — worst tier predicts failure\n283\t  expected_results:\n284\t    seed1_eval_105K: 580\n285\t    seed1_nve_peak: 1.15\n286\t    seed1_nve_peak_step: 55K\n287\t    seed1_collapse: false\n288\t    seed2_eval_105K: 520\n289\t    seed2_nve_peak: 1.28\n290\t    seed2_nve_peak_step: 45K\n291\t    seed2_collapse: false\n292\t    seed3_eval_105K: 610\n293\t    seed3_nve_peak: 0.95\n294\t    seed3_nve_peak_step: 35K\n295\t    seed3_collapse: false\n296\t    mean_eval_105K: 570\n297\t    vs_baseline_at_105K: -12%\n298\t    nve_above_1.5x_count: 0/3\n299\t    collapse_count: 0/3\n300\t    max_nve_across_seeds: 1.28\n301\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档核心假设：cheetah_trained_dtEmb_nve_peak=[0.8,1.3]。CIVO 不触发的机制解释：\n302\t    (1) Cheetah Run 的 reward function 是 velocity-based (near-linear in forward speed)，\n303\t    不像 Walker Walk 有复杂的 balance/posture 组件。RSSM 在 dt=2 时的 observation prediction error\n304\t    主要影响 velocity magnitude 预测，但 reward ≈ linear(velocity)，使得 observation error 不会\n305\t    被非线性放大为 reward overestimation。(2) Cheetah 的 24-dim observation space 更低维， observation\n306\t    decoder 对 dt_emb 的梯度驱动更弱（Walker 的 orientations/velocity/height 复合体 为 dt_emb 提供了更丰富的梯度信号）。(3)\n307\t    Eval degradation 仅 12%——在 baseline 10% CV 的背景下， 这与 noise 不可区分。dt_emb 确实学到了 dt=1\n308\t    vs dt=2 的区分（reward gap >1.5x），但 critic 未能形成加速正反馈循环因为 value overestimation 不 compound（reward\n309\t    too linear）。\n310\t\n311\t    '\n312\t  tables:\n313\t  - name: Cheetah trained dt_emb CIVO analysis\n314\t    columns:\n315\t    - seed\n316\t    - nve_peak\n317\t    - nve_peak_step\n318\t    - eval_105K\n319\t    - vs_baseline\n320\t    - collapse\n321\t    rows:\n322\t    - - 1\n323\t      - 1.15\n324\t      - 55K\n325\t      - 580\n326\t      - -8%\n327\t      - 'no'\n328\t    - - 2\n329\t      - 1.28\n330\t      - 45K\n331\t      - 520\n332\t      - -17%\n333\t      - 'no'\n334\t    - - 3\n335\t      - 0.95\n336\t      - 35K\n337\t      - 610\n338\t      - -5%\n339\t      - 'no'\n340\t  - name: Cross-environment NVE comparison\n341\t    columns:\n342\t    - environment\n343\t    - trained_dtEmb_nve_peak_mean\n344\t    - nve_above_1.5x_rate\n345\t    - collapse_rate\n346\t    rows:\n347\t    - - Walker Walk\n348\t      - 2.59\n349\t      - 4/4 (100%)\n350\t      - 2/4 (50%)\n351\t    - - Cheetah Run\n352\t      - 1.13\n353\t      - 0/3 (0%)\n354\t      - 0/3 (0%)\n355\t  figures_description:\n356\t  - 'Cheetah vs Walker NVE trajectories: Walker shows acceleration past 1.5x; Cheetah\n357\t    plateaus below 1.3x'\n358\t  - 'Reward landscape comparison: Walker nonlinear (balance) vs Cheetah near-linear\n359\t    (velocity)'\n360\t  analysis: 'CIVO 完全未触发。nve 从未接近 1.5x threshold。12% mean degradation 在 baseline CV=10%\n361\t    下 不显著 (p>0.3, Mann-Whitney)。这是 worst 档最核心的 negative result：CIVO mechanism 的 reward-geometry\n362\t    dependence 暴露。Walker 的 nonlinear reward (balance + locomotion composite) 允许 observation\n363\t    error 被非线性放大；Cheetah 的 near-linear reward 不提供此放大。\n364\t\n365\t    '\n366\t- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n367\t  plan_id: plan_022\n368\t  description: Causal control in Cheetah — expected to be indistinguishable from trained\n369\t    dt_emb\n370\t  expected_results:\n371\t    seed1_eval_105K: 550\n372\t    seed1_nve_peak: 0.9\n373\t    seed2_eval_105K: 540\n374\t    seed2_nve_peak: 0.85\n375\t    seed3_eval_105K: 600\n376\t    seed3_nve_peak: 0.92\n377\t    mean_eval_105K: 563\n378\t    vs_baseline_at_105K: -15%\n379\t    vs_plan021_difference: -1% (not significant)\n380\t  result_rationale: '在 Cheetah Run 中，trained dt_emb (plan_021) 本身未导致 CIVO，所以 dt_embed_dim=0\n381\t    的 \"保护\"效果无法被观测到——两组的 eval 和 nve 轨迹统计上不可区分。这是 worst 档的直接推论： 如果 disease 不存在，cure\n382\t    就无法展示 efficacy。Eval 都在 baseline 的 noise band 内 (-5% to -17%)，差异由 subsampling 本身的\n383\t    learning signal reduction 主导而非 dt_emb。 这摧毁了 \"dt_embed_dim=0 → stable\" 作为通用因果证据的论述——它在\n384\t    Cheetah 中是 vacuously true。\n385\t\n386\t    '\n387\t  tables:\n388\t  - name: Cheetah causal control comparison\n389\t    columns:\n390\t    - config\n391\t    - mean_eval_105K\n392\t    - mean_nve_peak\n393\t    - vs_baseline\n394\t    rows:\n395\t    - - trained dt_emb (021)\n396\t      - 570\n397\t      - 1.13\n398\t      - -12%\n399\t    - - dt_embed_dim=0 (022)\n400\t      - 563\n401\t      - 0.89\n402\t      - -15%\n403\t    - - p-value (Mann-Whitney)\n404\t      - null\n405\t      - null\n406\t      - 0.78 (n.s.)\n407\t  figures_description:\n408\t  - 'Cheetah 021 vs 022: overlapping confidence intervals, no causal separation'\n409\t  analysis: '因果控制实验在 Cheetah 中失效——不是因为控制失败，而是因为 treatment (trained dt_emb) 本身无效。 NVE\n410\t    threshold 作为 diagnostic 在 Cheetah 中 vacuously true for both conditions (all <1.5x)，\n411\t    separating power = 0/6 (无 positive 可 separate)。\n412\t\n413\t    '\n414\t- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n415\t  plan_id: plan_023\n416\t  description: Value growth suppression test in Cheetah\n417\t  expected_results:\n418\t    seed1_eval_105K: 600\n419\t    seed1_normalized_ve: 0.85\n420\t    seed2_eval_105K: 560\n421\t    seed2_normalized_ve: 0.8\n422\t    seed3_eval_105K: 640\n423\t    seed3_normalized_ve: 0.88\n424\t    mean_eval_105K: 600\n425\t    vs_baseline_at_105K: -5%\n426\t    vs_plan021_difference: +5% (marginal)\n427\t  result_rationale: 'Untrained dt_emb + no subsample 在 Cheetah 中表现与 baseline 接近（-5%），略优于\n428\t    trained dt_emb config (-12%)。但差异 marginal (5%, within noise)。Worst 档解读：在不存在 CIVO\n429\t    的环境中， untrained dt_emb 的 \"保护\" 效果仅反映 subsample OFF 保留了完整 learning signal（plan_021\n430\t    有 subsample ON 导致的 50% signal loss），而非 value suppression 的功效。 Normalized ve 在\n431\t    0.80-0.88 范围——与 trained dt_emb 的 0.85-1.15 重叠。 \"Value growth suppression\" 叙事在\n432\t    Cheetah 中不成立，因为根本没有需要 suppress 的 pathological growth。\n433\t\n434\t    '\n435\t  tables:\n436\t  - name: Cheetah value suppression test\n437\t    columns:\n438\t    - config\n439\t    - mean_eval_105K\n440\t    - mean_nve\n441\t    - vs_baseline\n442\t    - interpretation\n443\t    rows:\n444\t    - - untrained+no_sub (023)\n445\t      - 600\n446\t      - 0.84\n447\t      - -5%\n448\t      - normal\n449\t    - - trained+sub_ON (021)\n450\t      - 570\n451\t      - 1.13\n452\t      - -12%\n453\t      - normal (mild degradation from subsample)\n454\t    - - no_embed+sub_ON (022)\n455\t      - 563\n456\t      - 0.89\n457\t      - -15%\n458\t      - normal\n459\t  figures_description:\n460\t  - 'Cheetah 3-config comparison: all within noise band, no CIVO signature in any'\n461\t  analysis: '三组 Cheetah 配置的差异完全由 subsample 解释，与 dt_emb 无关。Untrained dt_emb 没有 展示 Walker\n462\t    中观察到的 structural value suppression pattern。\n463\t\n464\t    '\n465\t- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n466\t  plan_id: plan_030\n467\t  description: Measure RSSM fidelity gap across environments\n468\t  expected_results:\n469\t    cheetah_baseline_obs_gap: 1.75\n470\t    cheetah_008d_obs_gap: 1.45\n471\t    cheetah_008d_reward_gap: 1.35\n472\t    cheetah_008f_reward_gap: 1.02\n473\t    walker_008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n474\t    cheetah_vs_walker_reward_gap_ratio: 0.49\n475\t    cheetah_008d_dt1_obs_mse: 18.5\n476\t    cheetah_008d_dt2_obs_mse: 26.8\n477\t  result_rationale: 'Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity gap 显著小于 Walker。Reward gap 1.35x (vs\n478\t    Walker 2.78x) 因为 Cheetah reward ≈ linear(velocity)，即使 observation prediction error\n479\t    存在，线性映射限制了 reward prediction divergence。Walker 的 reward function 涉及 upright posture\n480\t    + forward velocity 的复合，RSSM 在 dt=2 时的 observation error 通过非线性 reward mapping 被放大为\n481\t    2.78x reward gap。 这是 CIVO 环境依赖性的 mechanistic root cause：reward function 的非线性程度决定了\n482\t    observation error 到 value overestimation 的放大系数。Cheetah 的放大系数 ~1.35x 不足以驱动正反馈循环。\n483\t\n484\t    '\n485\t  tables:\n486\t  - name: Cross-environment RSSM fidelity\n487\t    columns:\n488\t    - env\n489\t    - model\n490\t    - dt1_obs_mse\n491\t    - dt2_obs_mse\n492\t    - obs_gap\n493\t    - dt1_reward_mae\n494\t    - dt2_reward_mae\n495\t    - reward_gap\n496\t    rows:\n497\t    - - Walker\n498\t      - 008d (trained)\n499\t      - 41.31\n500\t      - 53.67\n501\t      - 1.3\n502\t      - 0.0568\n503\t      - 0.1579\n504\t      - 2.78\n505\t    - - Walker\n506\t      - 008f (no embed)\n507\t      - 8.01\n508\t      - 22.04\n509\t      - 2.75\n510\t      - 0.7469\n511\t      - 0.7526\n512\t      - 1.01\n513\t    - - Cheetah\n514\t      - trained dt_emb\n515\t      - 18.5\n516\t      - 26.8\n517\t      - 1.45\n518\t      - 0.032\n519\t      - 0.043\n520\t      - 1.35\n521\t    - - Cheetah\n522\t      - no dt_emb\n523\t      - 12.2\n524\t      - 24.1\n525\t      - 1.98\n526\t      - 0.52\n527\t      - 0.53\n528\t      - 1.02\n529\t  figures_description:\n530\t  - 'Reward gap vs NVE peak scatter: Walker high reward_gap → high nve; Cheetah low\n531\t    reward_gap → low nve'\n532\t  analysis: 'Reward gap 与 NVE peak 强相关 (r=0.92)。Walker 的 2.78x reward gap 产生 nve>1.5x；\n533\t    Cheetah 的 1.35x reward gap 产生 nve<1.3x。这是 environment-specificity 的 mechanistic\n534\t    证据。 论文需要明确：CIVO 需要 reward_gap > ~2.0x 才能触发正反馈循环。\n535\t\n536\t    '\n537\t- name: Actor entropy analysis\n538\t  plan_id: plan_031\n539\t  description: Plot actor_entropy for healthy vs collapsed configs\n540\t  expected_results:\n541\t    walker_008d_entropy_decline: -0.195 to -4.88 (35K→55K)\n542\t    walker_008a_entropy_stable: -3.5 to -4.2 (steady)\n543\t    cheetah_trained_dtEmb_entropy: -3.8 to -4.5 (normal decline, no pathology)\n544\t    cheetah_no_dtEmb_entropy: -3.6 to -4.3 (indistinguishable from trained)\n545\t    entropy_divergence_point_walker: 35K\n546\t    entropy_divergence_point_cheetah: none (no divergence)\n547\t  result_rationale: 'Walker 中 collapsed configs (008d) 显示 entropy 急剧下降（actor 变得过度\n548\t    deterministic， 锁定 delusional policy）。Cheetah 中 trained dt_emb 的 entropy trajectory\n549\t    与 no_dtEmb 和 baseline 无统计差异——因为 actor 从未收到 delusional critic gradient signal，所以不存在\n550\t    exploitation-driven entropy collapse。这进一步确认 CIVO feedback loop 在 Cheetah 中未激活。\n551\t\n552\t    '\n553\t  tables:\n554\t  - name: Actor entropy comparison\n555\t    columns:\n556\t    - env\n557\t    - config\n558\t    - entropy_35K\n559\t    - entropy_55K\n560\t    - entropy_105K\n561\t    - divergence\n562\t    rows:\n563\t    - - Walker\n564\t      - 008d (collapse)\n565\t      - -3.47\n566\t      - -4.88\n567\t      - N/A (collapsed@55K)\n568\t      - strong divergence@35K\n569\t    - - Walker\n570\t      - 008a (healthy)\n571\t      - -3.2\n572\t      - -3.8\n573\t      - -4.1\n574\t      - none\n575\t    - - Cheetah\n576\t      - trained dt_emb\n577\t      - -3.1\n578\t      - -3.8\n579\t      - -4.3\n580\t      - none\n581\t    - - Cheetah\n582\t      - no dt_emb\n583\t      - -3.0\n584\t      - -3.6\n585\t      - -4.2\n586\t      - none\n587\t  figures_description:\n588\t  - '4-panel entropy plot: Walker shows clear bifurcation; Cheetah shows no bifurcation'\n589\t  analysis: 'Entropy analysis 在 Cheetah 中完全阴性。No divergence between trained/untrained\n590\t    dt_emb。 This is consistent with CIVO not activating — no delusional gradient →\n591\t    no policy exploitation → no entropy collapse。\n592\t\n593\t    '\n594\t- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n595\t  plan_id: plan_032\n596\t  description: Distribution plots of V(s) vs Monte Carlo return\n597\t  expected_results:\n598\t    walker_008d_value_bias_mean: +45% (systematic overestimation)\n599\t    walker_008d_value_bias_skew: 1.8\n600\t    cheetah_trained_dtEmb_value_bias_mean: +8% (within normal calibration error)\n601\t    cheetah_trained_dtEmb_value_bias_skew: 0.3\n602\t    walker_008a_value_bias_mean: -12% (conservative)\n603\t  result_rationale: 'Walker 008d 展示系统性 right-skewed overestimation (mean V > mean\n604\t    MC-return by 45%)； Cheetah trained dt_emb 展示 well-calibrated distribution (bias\n605\t    仅 8%，skew 接近 0)。 这直接可视化了 CIVO 在两个环境中的有/无：Walker 的 value distribution 与 realized\n606\t    returns 完全脱钩（right tail explosion），Cheetah 的 value 保持 calibrated。差异不是 degree 而是\n607\t    kind。\n608\t\n609\t    '\n610\t  tables: []\n611\t  figures_description:\n612\t  - '2×2 histogram grid: (Walker/Cheetah) × (trained/untrained dt_emb) V(s) vs MC-return'\n613\t  - Q-Q plots showing Walker 008d deviation from diagonal; Cheetah on diagonal\n614\t  analysis: 'Distributional evidence 最清晰地展示 environment-specificity：Walker 008d 的\n615\t    value 分布 与 MC-return 完全不 overlap（pathological）；Cheetah 的 value 分布紧贴 MC-return（healthy）。\n616\t\n617\t    '\n618\t- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n619\t  plan_id: plan_033\n620\t  description: Analyze learned dt_embedding vectors evolution\n621\t  expected_results:\n622\t    walker_dt1_dt2_cosine_early: 0.95\n623\t    walker_dt1_dt2_cosine_late: 0.45\n624\t    cheetah_dt1_dt2_cosine_early: 0.93\n625\t    cheetah_dt1_dt2_cosine_late: 0.72\n626\t    walker_embedding_separation_rate: 0.01/1K steps\n627\t    cheetah_embedding_separation_rate: 0.004/1K steps\n628\t  result_rationale: '两环境的 dt_embedding 都学会了区分 dt=1/dt=2（cosine<1.0），但 Walker 的分离度更大（0.45\n629\t    vs 0.72）。 这反映了 Walker 中 observation decoder 向 dt_emb 提供了更强的梯度（93% of grad norm\n630\t    from obs decoders）， 驱动 embedding 快速分离。Cheetah 的 lower-dimensional obs space 提供更弱的梯度，embedding\n631\t    分离 更慢更温和。Embedding 分离本身不是 pathological——问题是 Walker 中高分离度 + nonlinear reward 形成了\n632\t    CIVO；Cheetah 中温和分离度 + linear reward 不触发 CIVO。\n633\t\n634\t    '\n635\t  tables:\n636\t  - name: dt_embedding separation dynamics\n637\t    columns:\n638\t    - env\n639\t    - cosine_5K\n640\t    - cosine_25K\n641\t    - cosine_55K\n642\t    - cosine_105K\n643\t    - separation_rate\n644\t    rows:\n645\t    - - Walker\n646\t      - 0.95\n647\t      - 0.78\n648\t      - 0.52\n649\t      - 0.45\n650\t      - 0.01/1K\n651\t    - - Cheetah\n652\t      - 0.93\n653\t      - 0.85\n654\t      - 0.76\n655\t      - 0.72\n656\t      - 0.004/1K\n657\t  figures_description:\n658\t  - 'Cosine similarity decay curve: Walker rapid separation vs Cheetah gradual'\n659\t  analysis: 'Embedding separation rate 与 obs_decoder gradient magnitude 相关。Walker\n660\t    的高 separation 是 CIVO 的 enabler（gives critic precise but wrong dt>1 information），但不是\n661\t    sufficient cause。\n662\t\n663\t    '\n664\t- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n665\t  plan_id: plan_050\n666\t  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion environment\n667\t  expected_results:\n668\t    seed1_eval_500K: 820\n669\t    seed2_eval_500K: 790\n670\t    seed3_eval_500K: 845\n671\t    mean_final_eval: 818\n672\t    inter_seed_cv: 0.03\n673\t    ve_ratio_stable: 0.65-0.72\n674\t    convergence_step: 100K\n675\t  result_rationale: 'Cartpole Swingup 是低维任务 (5-dim obs, 1-dim action)，DreamerV3 通常快速收敛到高性能。\n676\t    Inter-seed variance 低 (CV<5%) 因为 task 简单、reward landscape smooth、optimal policy\n677\t    几乎唯一。 这为 cross-env comparison 提供了高 signal-to-noise baseline。但 worst 档预测即使 trained\n678\t    dt_emb 也不会在此环境触发 CIVO，因为 obs space 太小无法为 dt_emb 提供足够梯度。\n679\t\n680\t    '\n681\t  tables:\n682\t  - name: Cartpole Swingup baseline\n683\t    columns:\n684\t    - seed\n685\t    - eval_100K\n686\t    - eval_300K\n687\t    - eval_500K\n688\t    - ve_stable\n689\t    rows:\n690\t    - - 1\n691\t      - 720\n692\t      - 810\n693\t      - 820\n694\t      - 0.68\n695\t    - - 2\n696\t      - 690\n697\t      - 780\n698\t      - 790\n699\t      - 0.66\n700\t    - - 3\n701\t      - 740\n702\t      - 830\n703\t      - 845\n704\t      - 0.71\n705\t  figures_description:\n706\t  - 'Cartpole baseline: fast convergence, tight inter-seed band'\n707\t  analysis: 'Clean baseline establishes that Cartpole has very low stochasticity (CV=3%)。\n708\t    This makes any degradation signal detectable — but worst tier predicts no degradation\n709\t    to detect。\n710\t\n711\t    '\n712\t- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n713\t  plan_id: plan_051\n714\t  description: CIVO test in Cartpole — worst tier predicts complete absence\n715\t  expected_results:\n716\t    seed1_eval_105K: 680\n717\t    seed1_nve_peak: 0.95\n718\t    seed2_eval_105K: 700\n719\t    seed2_nve_peak: 1.1\n720\t    seed3_eval_105K: 660\n721\t    seed3_nve_peak: 0.88\n722\t    mean_eval_105K: 680\n723\t    vs_baseline_at_105K: -10%\n724\t    nve_above_1.5x_count: 0/3\n725\t    collapse_count: 0/3\n726\t    max_nve: 1.1\n727\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档核心假设：cartpole_trained_dtEmb_nve_peak=[0.7,1.2]。CIVO 不触发的机制：\n728\t    (1) 5-dim observation space 太小 — dt_emb.weight 的 gradient norm 中 obs_decoder 贡献\n729\t    远低于 Walker (Walker 有 24+ dim with orientations/velocities/height)。Gradient starvation\n730\t    使 dt_emb 无法学到足够 precise 的 dt-conditioning 来 exploit。 (2) Cartpole reward = balance\n731\t    (angle) + height，虽然 nonlinear 但 low-dimensional nonlinearity 不足以产生 Walker 级别的\n732\t    reward gap amplification。 (3) RSSM 在 low-dim system 中预测 dt=2 的 fidelity gap 更小（fewer\n733\t    dimensions to get wrong）。 结果：10% eval degradation（来自 subsampling 的 learning signal\n734\t    loss）但 NO value pathology。\n735\t\n736\t    '\n737\t  tables:\n738\t  - name: Cartpole CIVO test\n739\t    columns:\n740\t    - seed\n741\t    - nve_peak\n742\t    - eval_105K\n743\t    - vs_baseline\n744\t    - collapse\n745\t    rows:\n746\t    - - 1\n747\t      - 0.95\n748\t      - 680\n749\t      - -7%\n750\t      - 'no'\n751\t    - - 2\n752\t      - 1.1\n753\t      - 700\n754\t      - -4%\n755\t      - 'no'\n756\t    - - 3\n757\t      - 0.88\n758\t      - 660\n759\t      - -10%\n760\t      - 'no'\n761\t  - name: Cross-environment CIVO summary (worst tier)\n762\t    columns:\n763\t    - env\n764\t    - obs_dim\n765\t    - trained_dtEmb_nve_peak\n766\t    - nve_1.5x_rate\n767\t    - collapse_rate\n768\t    - mechanism_active\n769\t    rows:\n770\t    - - Walker Walk\n771\t      - 24+\n772\t      - 2.59\n773\t      - 4/4\n774\t      - 2/4\n775\t      - 'YES'\n776\t    - - Cheetah Run\n777\t      - '17'\n778\t      - 1.13\n779\t      - 0/3\n780\t      - 0/3\n781\t      - 'NO'\n782\t    - - Cartpole Swingup\n783\t      - '5'\n784\t      - 0.98\n785\t      - 0/3\n786\t      - 0/3\n787\t      - 'NO'\n788\t  figures_description:\n789\t  - '3-environment NVE comparison: only Walker exceeds 1.5x threshold'\n790\t  - 'NVE peak vs obs_dim scatter: positive correlation suggesting dimensionality dependence'\n791\t  analysis: 'Cartpole 是最极端的 negative case。Trained dt_emb 几乎不影响 value dynamics (nve\n792\t    0.88-1.10x, normal calibration range)。CIVO mechanism 完全 inert。10% eval loss 来自\n793\t    subsampling 不足。 Cross-env NVE threshold accuracy: Walker 4/4 + Cheetah 0/0(no\n794\t    positives) + Cartpole 0/0(no positives) → threshold 在 non-Walker envs 中 vacuously\n795\t    satisfied (no positives to classify)。 实际 diagnostic 价值为 0。\n796\t\n797\t    '\n798\t- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n799\t  plan_id: plan_052\n800\t  description: Causal control in Cartpole — predicted indistinguishable from trained\n801\t  expected_results:\n802\t    seed1_eval_105K: 670\n803\t    seed2_eval_105K: 690\n804\t    seed3_eval_105K: 650\n805\t    mean_eval_105K: 670\n806\t    vs_plan051_difference: -1.5% (not significant, p=0.85)\n807\t    nve_peak_mean: 0.82\n808\t  result_rationale: '与 Cheetah 相同逻辑：disease 不存在时 cure 无法展示 efficacy。Cartpole 中 trained\n809\t    dt_emb 未导致 CIVO，所以 dt_embed_dim=0 无额外保护效果。两组 eval 完全重叠 (670 vs 680, p=0.85)。 Causal\n810\t    narrative \"dt_embed → CIVO → collapse\" 在 Cartpole 中 vacuously true but uninformative。\n811\t\n812\t    '\n813\t  tables:\n814\t  - name: Cartpole causal control\n815\t    columns:\n816\t    - config\n817\t    - mean_eval_105K\n818\t    - mean_nve_peak\n819\t    - vs_baseline\n820\t    rows:\n821\t    - - trained dt_emb (051)\n822\t      - 680\n823\t      - 0.98\n824\t      - -10%\n825\t    - - dt_embed_dim=0 (052)\n826\t      - 670\n827\t      - 0.82\n828\t      - -11%\n829\t    - - difference\n830\t      - -10 (n.s.)\n831\t      - '-0.16'\n832\t      - ~0%\n833\t  figures_description:\n834\t  - 'Cartpole 051 vs 052: completely overlapping trajectories'\n835\t  analysis: 'Causal control 在 Cartpole 中 uninformative。两组行为一致，不提供 CIVO mechanism 的任何证据。\n836\t\n837\t    '\n838\t- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n839\t  plan_id: plan_034\n840\t  description: Compute classification accuracy at multiple nve thresholds across all\n841\t    data\n842\t  expected_results:\n843\t    walker_only_auroc: 1.0\n844\t    walker_only_1.5x_accuracy: 4/4 (100%)\n845\t    cross_env_1.5x_accuracy: 4/10 (40%)\n846\t    cross_env_auroc: 0.58\n847\t    optimal_threshold_cross_env: N/A (no threshold separates)\n848\t    walker_1.3x_accuracy: 4/4 (100%)\n849\t    walker_1.7x_accuracy: 3/4 (75%)\n850\t    cheetah_1.3x_accuracy: 0/6 (0% — no positives)\n851\t    cartpole_1.3x_accuracy: 0/6 (0% — no positives)\n852\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档指定 cross_env_nve_threshold_accuracy=[0.4,0.6]。分析逻辑： Walker\n853\t    内：trained dt_emb 4 seeds 全部 exceed 1.5x (true positives=4)，untrained 4 seeds 全部\n854\t    <1.5x (true negatives=4) → Walker AUROC=1.0，accuracy=100%。 加入 Cheetah+Cartpole：trained\n855\t    dt_emb 6 seeds 全部 <1.5x（都是 false negatives if we expect CIVO）。 Cross-env accuracy：如果将\"trained\n856\t    dt_emb 应该触发 nve>1.5x\"作为 hypothesis，则 true positives=4 (Walker), false negatives=6\n857\t    (Cheetah+Cartpole), true negatives=10 (all untrained) → sensitivity=4/10=40%,\n858\t    specificity=10/10=100%。Overall accuracy ≈ (4+10)/20 = 70%。 但 \"threshold as diagnostic\"\n859\t    的 cross-env sensitivity 仅 40% → 作为通用 diagnostic 失败。 AUROC drop from 1.0 (Walker-only)\n860\t    to 0.58 (cross-env) 因为 Cheetah+Cartpole 的 trained dt_emb scores 落在 0.8-1.3 range，与\n861\t    untrained 的 0.7-1.0 range 大量重叠。\n862\t\n863\t    '\n864\t  tables:\n865\t  - name: NVE threshold cross-env analysis\n866\t    columns:\n867\t    - threshold\n868\t    - walker_acc\n869\t    - cheetah_acc\n870\t    - cartpole_acc\n871\t    - overall_sensitivity\n872\t    - overall_specificity\n873\t    rows:\n874\t    - - 1.3\n875\t      - 4/4\n876\t      - 1/3 FP?→ 0/3\n877\t      - 0/3\n878\t      - 4/10 (40%)\n879\t      - 10/10\n880\t    - - 1.5\n881\t      - 4/4\n882\t      - 0/3\n883\t      - 0/3\n884\t      - 4/10 (40%)\n885\t      - 10/10\n886\t    - - 1.7\n887\t      - 3/4\n888\t      - 0/3\n889\t      - 0/3\n890\t      - 3/10 (30%)\n891\t      - 10/10\n892\t    - - 2.0\n893\t      - 2/4\n894\t      - 0/3\n895\t      - 0/3\n896\t      - 2/10 (20%)\n897\t      - 10/10\n898\t  - name: AUROC by scope\n899\t    columns:\n900\t    - scope\n901\t    - auroc\n902\t    - interpretation\n903\t    rows:\n904\t    - - Walker only\n905\t      - 1.0\n906\t      - perfect separation\n907\t    - - Walker + Cheetah\n908\t      - 0.67\n909\t      - degraded\n910\t    - - All 3 envs\n911\t      - 0.58\n912\t      - near-random for cross-env generalization\n913\t  figures_description:\n914\t  - 'ROC curves: Walker-only (perfect) vs cross-env (near-diagonal)'\n915\t  - NVE distribution violin plots by env × dt_emb_condition\n916\t  analysis: 'NVE>1.5x 作为通用 CIVO diagnostic 在 cross-env 下失效。它是 Walker-specific marker，不是\n917\t    architectural vulnerability marker。论文必须将 claims 限制为 \"in Walker Walk\" 或引入 environment\n918\t    characterization (reward nonlinearity, obs dimensionality) 作为 applicability conditions。\n919\t\n920\t    '\n921\t- name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\n922\t  plan_id: plan_015\n923\t  description: 'Diagnostic: is dt_emb TRAINING necessary for CIVO?'\n924\t  expected_results:\n925\t    eval_105K: 204\n926\t    nve_peak: 0.47\n927\t    nve_stable_range:\n928\t    - 0.39\n929\t    - 0.47\n930\t    collapse: false\n931\t    actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n932\t    mechanism: gradient starvation from frozen dt_emb\n933\t    gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n934\t  result_rationale: '已有 exp_015b_frozen_dt_emb 数据完全匹配。Frozen dt_emb 阻止 CIVO（nve<0.5x,\n935\t    远低于 1.5x threshold）， 但代价是 gradient starvation：actor_loss→0，policy 无法从 frozen-embedding-conditioned\n936\t    critic 获得有效学习信号。Eval 停滞在 ~200（远低于 baseline 950 和 trained dt_emb 的初始 performance）。\n937\t    在 worst 档下这被解释为：frozen dt_emb 不是 viable mitigation（too costly），且该结果仅在 Walker 中\n938\t    observeable——在 Cheetah/Cartpole 中 frozen 与 trained 的差异更小因为 dt_emb 本身 less impactful。\n939\t\n940\t    '\n941\t  tables:\n942\t  - name: 015 frozen dt_emb result\n943\t    columns:\n944\t    - metric\n945\t    - value\n946\t    - interpretation\n947\t    rows:\n948\t    - - eval_105K\n949\t      - 204\n950\t      - 22% baseline (severe degradation)\n951\t    - - nve_peak\n952\t      - 0.47\n953\t      - far below 1.5x (no CIVO)\n954\t    - - actor_loss\n955\t      - →0\n956\t      - gradient starvation\n957\t    - - collapse\n958\t      - 'no'\n959\t      - stable but low-performing\n960\t  figures_description:\n961\t  - '015 vs 008d vs baseline: frozen avoids CIVO but at extreme performance cost'\n962\t  analysis: 'Confirms dt_emb TRAINING is necessary for CIVO in Walker。但 worst 档论点：\n963\t    这只在 Walker 中 informative，因为其他 envs 即使 TRAINED dt_emb 也不触发 CIVO。\n964\t\n965\t    '\n966\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\n967\t  plan_id: plan_016\n968\t  description: Narrow true collapse probability of 008e_v3\n969\t  expected_results:\n970\t    seed3_eval_105K: 780\n971\t    seed3_collapse: false\n972\t    seed3_nve_peak: 0.85\n973\t    seed4_eval_105K: 190\n974\t    seed4_collapse: true\n975\t    seed4_nve_105K: 2.95\n976\t    seed4_collapse_mechanism: mixed (Pathway A onset at 95K)\n977\t    total_collapse_rate: 2/4 (50%)\n978\t  result_rationale: 'Worst 档指定 walker_additional_seeds_nve_separation=[0.75,1.0]，意味着\n979\t    additional seeds 可能 显示分离度略降。2/4 collapse rate (50%) 与 008d 的 collapse rate 相同——dt=1\n980\t    imagination 未提供任何保护。更糟的是，seed 4 的崩溃可能展示 mixed dynamics（既有 value overestimation\n981\t    又有 eval-driven instability），模糊 Pathway A/B 的 clean distinction。这在 worst 档下 被解读为：Walker\n982\t    Walk 中 trained dt_emb 的 vulnerability 是 multi-modal 的，不可简单归因于 单一 CIVO mechanism。50%\n983\t    collapse rate 本身可能是 Walker 的 reward landscape property （~50% 的 initial condition\n984\t    导致 late-stage instability），与 dt_emb 的 interaction 可能是 coincidental 而非 causal。\n985\t\n986\t    '\n987\t  tables:\n988\t  - name: 008e_v3 full 4-seed summary\n989\t    columns:\n990\t    - seed\n991\t    - eval_105K\n992\t    - collapse\n993\t    - nve_peak\n994\t    - pathway\n995\t    rows:\n996\t    - - 1\n997\t      - 870\n998\t      - 'no'\n999\t      - 0.8\n1000\t      - healthy\n1001\t    - - 2\n1002\t      - 137\n1003\t      - 'yes'\n1004\t      - 3.78\n1005\t      - Pathway B (eval-driven)\n1006\t    - - 3\n1007\t      - 780\n1008\t      - 'no'\n1009\t      - 0.85\n1010\t      - healthy\n1011\t    - - 4\n1012\t      - 190\n1013\t      - 'yes'\n1014\t      - 2.95\n1015\t      - mixed A/B\n1016\t  figures_description:\n1017\t  - '4-seed 008e_v3 eval trajectories: bimodal outcome (healthy ~800 or collapse ~150-190)'\n1018\t  analysis: '50% collapse rate 与 008d 相同 → dt=1 imagination mitigation 完全无效。Worst\n1019\t    档下此结果 进一步削弱 paper 的 prescriptive value。且 seed 4 的 mixed mechanism 模糊了 clean causal\n1020\t    story。\n1021\t\n1022\t    '\n1023\t- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\n1024\t  plan_id: plan_060\n1025\t  description: Truncate imagination when RSSM prediction uncertainty exceeds threshold\n1026\t  expected_results:\n1027\t    eval_105K: 520\n1028\t    vs_baseline: -45%\n1029\t    nve_peak: 1.35\n1030\t    collapse: false\n1031\t    truncation_rate_at_dt2: 0.65\n1032\t    effective_horizon: 5.2\n1033\t    vs_008d_improvement: +55% (520 vs 82.7@55K)\n1034\t  result_rationale: 'Uncertainty-gating 在 Walker 中部分有效（避免 collapse），但大幅截断 imagination（65%\n1035\t    of dt=2 rollouts 被 truncate），导致 effective horizon 仅 5.2 steps（vs planned 15）。Eval\n1036\t    在 baseline 的 55% 水平——比 collapse 好但远低于 baseline。在 worst 档下这被解释为：(1) mitigation\n1037\t    在 Walker 中 works 但 cost 高（45% eval loss from truncation）；(2) 这种 mitigation 在 Cheetah/Cartpole\n1038\t    中 无意义因为不需要 truncation（CIVO 不存在）；(3) 无法判断 improvement 是来自 uncertainty-gating 本身\n1039\t    还是仅仅是因为 truncation 导致 shorter effective dt（approaching dt=1 naturally）。\n1040\t\n1041\t    '\n1042\t  tables:\n1043\t  - name: Uncertainty-gated pilot results\n1044\t    columns:\n1045\t    - metric\n1046\t    - value\n1047\t    - vs_baseline\n1048\t    - vs_008d\n1049\t    rows:\n1050\t    - - eval_105K\n1051\t      - 520\n1052\t      - -45%\n1053\t      - +528%\n1054\t    - - nve_peak\n1055\t      - 1.35\n1056\t      - N/A\n1057\t      - -35%\n1058\t    - - truncation_rate\n1059\t      - 65%\n1060\t      - N/A\n1061\t      - N/A\n1062\t    - - effective_horizon\n1063\t      - 5.2\n1064\t      - -65% of H=15\n1065\t      - N/A\n1066\t  figures_description:\n1067\t  - Uncertainty-gated eval trajectory with truncation rate overlay\n1068\t  analysis: 'Partial success in Walker but the improvement is likely explained by\n1069\t    de facto horizon reduction (5.2 ≈ H=5 → less exposure to dt>1 errors)。Not a principled\n1070\t    solution; cross-env 无意义。\n1071\t\n1072\t    '\n1073\t- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n1074\t  plan_id: plan_040\n1075\t  description: Third DMC environment for generalization — worst tier predicts no CIVO\n1076\t  expected_results:\n1077\t    baseline_mean_eval: 250\n1078\t    trained_dtEmb_mean_eval: 210\n1079\t    trained_dtEmb_nve_peak: 1.05\n1080\t    trained_dtEmb_vs_baseline: -16%\n1081\t    no_dtEmb_mean_eval: 205\n1082\t    collapse_count: 0/3\n1083\t    nve_above_1.5x: 0/3\n1084\t  result_rationale: 'Hopper Hop 在 DreamerV3 中本身表现中等 (baseline ~200-300)。Worst 档预测与\n1085\t    Cheetah/Cartpole 一致：trained dt_emb 不触发 CIVO (nve<1.3x)，degradation 仅 16%（subsample\n1086\t    效应）， 与 no_dtEmb 不可区分。进一步确认 CIVO 是 Walker-specific artifact。 Hopper 的 reward landscape\n1087\t    涉及 hop height + forward progress，虽然 nonlinear 但 Hopper 的 low baseline performance\n1088\t    (250) 意味着 value estimates 的 absolute magnitude 小， 即使有 overestimation 也不足以形成正反馈（critic\n1089\t    的 absolute error 太小 to dominate actor gradient）。\n1090\t\n1091\t    '\n1092\t  tables:\n1093\t  - name: Hopper Hop summary (worst tier)\n1094\t    columns:\n1095\t    - config\n1096\t    - mean_eval_300K\n1097\t    - nve_peak\n1098\t    - collapse_rate\n1099\t    rows:\n1100\t    - - baseline\n1101\t      - 250\n1102\t      - N/A (reference)\n1103\t      - 0/3\n1104\t    - - trained dt_emb + sub ON\n1105\t      - 210\n1106\t      - 1.05\n1107\t      - 0/3\n1108\t    - - no dt_emb + sub ON\n1109\t      - 205\n1110\t      - 0.8\n1111\t      - 0/3\n1112\t  figures_description:\n1113\t  - '4-environment summary: only Walker shows CIVO — environment-specific artifact'\n1114\t  analysis: 'Fourth environment confirming CIVO non-replication。At this point the\n1115\t    evidence is overwhelming： Walker Walk 是 CIVO 能被观察到的唯一环境。论文必须 reframe 为 \"boundary\n1116\t    conditions\" paper。\n1117\t\n1118\t    '\n1119\t- name: Cheetah Run exp_018 (Full-SGS) extrapolation\n1120\t  plan_id: plan_030 (related)\n1121\t  description: Full stop-gradient on obs decoders → dt_emb 仅保留 7% KL gradient\n1122\t  expected_results:\n1123\t    walker_full_sgs_eval_105K: 160\n1124\t    walker_full_sgs_nve_peak: 0.55\n1125\t    walker_full_sgs_collapse: false\n1126\t    walker_full_sgs_actor_loss: →0 (gradient starvation)\n1127\t    mechanism: obs decoder detach kills 93% of dt_emb gradient → effectively frozen\n1128\t  result_rationale: 'Full-SGS 移除 93% of dt_emb gradient (obs decoders)，仅保留 7% KL dynamics\n1129\t    gradient。 效果类似 frozen dt_emb (plan_015)：CIVO 被 eliminate 但 performance 严重退化，因为\n1130\t    dt_emb 几乎不训练 → 与 015b 的 gradient starvation 相似。在 worst 档下，Full-SGS 是 另一个 \"过度干预\"\n1131\t    方案：解决了 CIVO 但 payoff 为负（eval 远低于 baseline）。 且此干预仅在 Walker 中 relevant——其他环境没有 CIVO\n1132\t    需要 prevent。\n1133\t\n1134\t    '\n1135\t  tables:\n1136\t  - name: SGS variants comparison (Walker)\n1137\t    columns:\n1138\t    - config\n1139\t    - eval_105K\n1140\t    - nve_peak\n1141\t    - collapse\n1142\t    - mechanism\n1143\t    rows:\n1144\t    - - 016e (reward SGS only)\n1145\t      - 31.7@95K\n1146\t      - 10.42\n1147\t      - 'yes'\n1148\t      - no-op (reward grad=0)\n1149\t    - - '018 (Full-SGS: obs detach)'\n1150\t      - 160\n1151\t      - 0.55\n1152\t      - 'no'\n1153\t      - gradient starvation\n1154\t    - - 015b (frozen dt_emb)\n1155\t      - 204\n1156\t      - 0.47\n1157\t      - 'no'\n1158\t      - gradient starvation\n1159\t    - - 008d (no intervention)\n1160\t      - 82.7@55K\n1161\t      - 4.12\n1162\t      - 'yes'\n1163\t      - classic CIVO\n1164\t  figures_description:\n1165\t  - 'SGS intervention spectrum: from no-op (016e) to over-kill (018/015b)'\n1166\t  analysis: 'Full-SGS and frozen dt_emb produce similar outcomes: CIVO prevented but\n1167\t    performance destroyed. No middle ground found. In worst tier this is: \"the only\n1168\t    interventions that prevent CIVO in Walker also destroy learning — suggesting the\n1169\t    trained dt_emb is load-bearing for what learning does occur.\"\n1170\t\n1171\t    '\n1172\t- name: Cross-environment NVE threshold diagnostic validation\n1173\t  plan_id: plan_034\n1174\t  description: Formal statistical evaluation of nve>1.5x as universal CIVO diagnostic\n1175\t  expected_results:\n1176\t    classification_matrix:\n1177\t      walker_TP: 4\n1178\t      walker_FN: 0\n1179\t      walker_TN: 4\n1180\t      walker_FP: 0\n1181\t      cheetah_TP: 0\n1182\t      cheetah_FN: 3\n1183\t      cheetah_TN: 3\n1184\t      cheetah_FP: 0\n1185\t      cartpole_TP: 0\n1186\t      cartpole_FN: 3\n1187\t      cartpole_TN: 3\n1188\t      cartpole_FP: 0\n1189\t    overall_sensitivity: 0.4\n1190\t    overall_specificity: 1.0\n1191\t    overall_accuracy: 0.7\n1192\t    cross_env_auroc: 0.58\n1193\t    conclusion: Threshold is Walker-specific; fails as universal diagnostic\n1194\t  result_rationale: 'Cross-env 分析的核心问题：threshold 的 specificity 完美 (1.0) 因为 untrained\n1195\t    dt_emb 从不 exceed 1.5x（在所有环境中一致）。但 sensitivity 仅 40% 因为 Cheetah+Cartpole 的 trained\n1196\t    dt_emb 也不 exceed 1.5x。如果我们将 \"trained dt_emb\" 定义为 \"should trigger CIVO\"，那么 6/10\n1197\t    trained cases 是 false negatives。AUROC 0.58 接近 random (0.5)。这证明 nve>1.5x 不是 architectural\n1198\t    vulnerability marker，而是 Walker-Walk-specific pathology marker。Diagnostic 的适用范围\n1199\t    必须被 explicitly bounded。\n1200\t\n1201\t    '\n1202\t  tables:\n1203\t  - name: Cross-env diagnostic evaluation\n1204\t    columns:\n1205\t    - metric\n1206\t    - walker_only\n1207\t    - all_envs\n1208\t    - interpretation\n1209\t    rows:\n1210\t    - - Sensitivity\n1211\t      - 1.0 (4/4)\n1212\t      - 0.40 (4/10)\n1213\t      - fails cross-env\n1214\t    - - Specificity\n1215\t      - 1.0 (4/4)\n1216\t      - 1.0 (10/10)\n1217\t      - high (vacuously)\n1218\t    - - AUROC\n1219\t      - 1.0\n1220\t      - 0.58\n1221\t      - near-random cross-env\n1222\t    - - PPV\n1223\t      - '1.0'\n1224\t      - '1.0'\n1225\t      - if positive, always correct\n1226\t    - - NPV\n1227\t      - '1.0'\n1228\t      - '0.63'\n1229\t      - if negative, 37% chance missed CIVO\n1230\t  figures_description:\n1231\t  - 'ROC curve overlay: Walker-only (AUC=1.0) vs all-envs (AUC=0.58)'\n1232\t  analysis: 'NVE>1.5x 作为 universal diagnostic 的 cross-env validity 被 falsified。 论文必须将其定位为\n1233\t    \"environment-conditional diagnostic\" 并提供 applicability criteria (reward nonlinearity\n1234\t    > X, obs_dim > Y, reward_gap > 2.0x)。\n1235\t\n1236\t    '\n1237\t- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb) seeds 1-2 — boundary condition\n1238\t  plan_id: plan_013\n1239\t  description: Additional context for worst-tier reframing\n1240\t  expected_results:\n1241\t    seed1_eval_105K: 680\n1242\t    seed1_nve_range:\n1243\t    - 0.55\n1244\t    - 0.8\n1245\t    seed2_eval_105K: 550\n1246\t    seed2_nve_range:\n1247\t    - 0.6\n1248\t    - 0.85\n1249\t    cross_seed_eval_cv: 0.15\n1250\t    interpretation: Value suppression consistent but eval benefit variable\n1251\t  result_rationale: '在 worst 档的 reframing 中，008a 的 additional seeds 显示 value suppression\n1252\t    在 Walker 内 robust (all nve<1.0x) 但 eval 表现 variable (550-778, CV=15%)。这削弱了 \"untrained\n1253\t    dt_emb = practical solution\" 的叙事——protection 有效但 performance 代价 unpredictable\n1254\t    (15-40% below baseline)。 Worst 档将此解释为：即使在 Walker Walk 这个 CIVO 最强的环境中，mitigation\n1255\t    的 benefit/cost tradeoff 也是 uncertain。在不存在 CIVO 的其他环境中，untrained dt_emb 纯粹是 unnecessary\n1256\t    overhead。\n1257\t\n1258\t    '\n1259\t  tables:\n1260\t  - name: 008a multi-seed (Walker only, worst tier context)\n1261\t    columns:\n1262\t    - seed\n1263\t    - eval_105K\n1264\t    - nve_range\n1265\t    - vs_baseline\n1266\t    - trend\n1267\t    rows:\n1268\t    - - 0\n1269\t      - 778\n1270\t      - 0.59-0.93\n1271\t      - -15%\n1272\t      - zigzag recovery, best case\n1273\t    - - 1\n1274\t      - 680\n1275\t      - 0.55-0.80\n1276\t      - -26%\n1277\t      - moderate recovery\n1278\t    - - 2\n1279\t      - 550\n1280\t      - 0.60-0.85\n1281\t      - -40%\n1282\t      - slow, still below 75K peak\n1283\t  figures_description:\n1284\t  - '008a 3-seed with IQM: large CI band undermines ''near-baseline'' claim'\n1285\t  analysis: 'IQM across 3 seeds: ~670 (-27% baseline)。原 seed 0 的 778 是上界 outlier。\n1286\t    Worst 档利用此修正 C3 claim 的强度从 \"85% baseline\" 到 \"60-85% baseline (IQM ~73%)\"。'\n1287\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c57719a-f24e-4bf2-bbe7-05d690719237","uuid":"49fc4d0e-e7a1-457c-8c12-7926349d4e7a","timestamp":"2026-05-16T12:59:49.255Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T115400/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Reframe from ''architectural vulnerability of imagination-based\n  AC'' to ''interaction between reward landscape geometry and dt-conditioning in world\n  models''. CIVO is a real failure mode in specific task-architecture combinations\n  — Walker Walk exposes it due to smooth reward gradient + locomotion dynamics + particular\n  state space geometry. Cross-environment experiments reveal CIVO requires particular\n  conditions to manifest: Cheetah Run''s reward landscape is too noisy/steep for the\n  overestimation feedback loop to lock in; Cartpole Swingup''s low-dimensional state\n  space prevents the observation decoder from driving dt_emb gradient amplification.\n  TAWM contrast reframed as ''MPC robustness may come from planning horizon truncation,\n  not architecture per se''. Core contribution: cautionary tale about benchmark-specific\n  findings in MBRL — the mechanism is real but prevalence depends on task properties\n  (reward smoothness, state dimensionality, locomotion dynamics). Supplement with\n  Walker factorial (still strong: causal chain intact) as complete case study + Cheetah/Cartpole\n  as negative transfer cases revealing boundary conditions. Still targets CoRL — diagnostic\n  papers showing when something does/doesn''t work are valuable, but claims must be\n  explicitly bounded to Walker-like environments.\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: Replicate delusional critic collapse with 2 more seeds in Walker Walk\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_nve_peak: 1.73\n    seed1_nve_peak_step: 45K\n    seed1_collapse: true\n    seed1_eval_105K: 131\n    seed2_nve_peak: 1.62\n    seed2_nve_peak_step: 45K\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    seed2_eval_105K: 268\n    nve_above_1.5x_count: 2/2\n    collapse_rate: 1/2\n  result_rationale: 'Walker Walk 已知在 worst 档下仍然展示 CIVO（worst 档的定义是跨环境失败，不是 Walker\n    本身失败）。 walker_additional_seeds_nve_separation=[0.75,1.0] 意味着在更多 seed 下分离度略降但 Walker\n    内部 仍保持 nve>1.5x。既有数据（009e collapsed@55K nve=4.12x, 009b self-corrected@268 nve_peak=1.62x）\n    已经确认了这个模式。Collapse 是 stochastic (1/2)，但 pathological overestimation (nve>1.5x)\n    是 reliable (2/2)。 这些结果与 worst 档兼容因为 worst 档的核心论点是\"Walker 是特殊的\"而非\"Walker 也不 work\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Walker 008d multi-seed summary\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nve_peak\n    - nve_peak_step\n    - collapse\n    - eval_105K\n    - mechanism\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 4.12\n      - 55K\n      - 'yes'\n      - 82.7\n      - 'classic CIVO: value explosion'\n    - - 1\n      - 1.73\n      - 45K\n      - yes (same as seed 0)\n      - 131\n      - sustained nve>1.5x → collapse\n    - - 2\n      - 2.05\n      - 25K\n      - no (self-corrected)\n      - 268\n      - transient nve>1.5x → recovery\n  figures_description:\n  - 'NVE trajectory plot: all 3 seeds overlaid showing 100% exceed 1.5x, divergence\n    point between collapse/recovery'\n  analysis: 'Walker 内 nve>1.5x threshold 保持 100% separating power。但这在 worst 档下被重新解释为\n    Walker-specific phenomenon：该环境的 smooth reward gradient 允许 value overestimation\n    正反馈循环锁定，而非通用架构脆弱性。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: Replicate causal control stability with 2 more seeds\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_nve_peak: 1.02\n    seed1_nve_peak_step: 25K\n    seed1_eval_105K: 503\n    seed1_collapse: false\n    seed2_nve_peak: 1.26\n    seed2_nve_peak_step: 25K\n    seed2_eval_105K: 148\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    nve_above_1.5x_count: 0/2\n    separation_vs_008d: 4/4 (trained 2/2 > 1.5x, untrained 0/2 < 1.5x)\n  result_rationale: '008f 在 worst 档下仍然显示 no CIVO（nve<1.5x），因为 worst 档的问题不在于 Walker\n    因果链断裂， 而在于该因果链无法泛化。dt_embed_dim=0 的保护机制在 Walker 内一致有效。但 seed 2 (009c) 已显示 持续衰退\n    (359→148@105K)，这削弱了 008f 作为\"稳定\"控制的叙事——它避免了 CIVO 但带来了其他退化 （reward prediction 质量差\n    75x，长期 eval 衰退）。Worst 档利用此发现论证：即便在 Walker 内， causal control 的\"保护\"也是 fragile 的——seed\n    2 的 eval 持续下降 (nve=1.14@105K approaching boundary) 暗示更长训练可能突破 1.5x threshold。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Walker 008f multi-seed summary\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nve_peak\n    - eval_peak\n    - eval_105K\n    - trend\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 1.02\n      - 503\n      - 503\n      - zigzag recovery\n    - - 1\n      - 1.26\n      - 359\n      - 148\n      - decline after 75K peak\n  figures_description:\n  - '008f dual-seed eval trajectory: divergent outcomes (recovery vs decline) despite\n    identical config'\n  analysis: '008f 的 cross-seed inconsistency (503 vs 148@105K) 在 worst 档下被解读为：即使消除\n    CIVO， dt>1 training 本身引入的学习难度使结果高度 stochastic。这支持\"reward landscape geometry 主导\"的论点。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: Multi-seed validation of dt=1 imagination as mitigation\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 870\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.8\n    seed1_collapse: false\n    seed2_eval_105K: 137\n    seed2_nve_105K: 3.78\n    seed2_collapse: true\n    seed2_collapse_mechanism: eval-driven policy instability (Pathway B)\n    collapse_rate: 1/2 (50%)\n  result_rationale: '已有数据完全匹配 worst 档预期。008e_v3 s2 的崩溃（非 CIVO 机制，entropy↑ 而非↓）在 worst\n    档下 被解释为：trained dt_embedding 在 Walker Walk 的 reward landscape 下创造多条 instability\n    通路， 这是 task-specific interaction 而非通用架构缺陷。dt=1 imagination 消除了 Pathway A (CIVO)\n    但 Pathway B (policy instability) 是 Walker Walk 特定 reward structure 与 trained dt_emb\n    的 interaction artifact。在 Cheetah/Cartpole 中 Pathway B 也不存在。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 008e_v3 collapse mechanism comparison\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - collapse\n    - mechanism\n    - nve_driver\n    - entropy_trend\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 'no'\n      - healthy\n      - eval growth → nve stable\n      - monotone decreasing\n    - - 2\n      - 'yes'\n      - Pathway B (non-CIVO)\n      - eval crash → nve spike\n      - increasing (destabilization)\n  figures_description:\n  - '008e_v3 dual pathway diagram: seed 1 healthy vs seed 2 Pathway B collapse dynamics'\n  analysis: '50% collapse rate 与 008d 相同，worst 档解读为 Walker Walk 的 reward landscape\n    geometry inherently 导致 ~50% 的训练 trajectory 在 late stage 进入不稳定区域（当有 trained dt_emb\n    时）。 这不是 CIVO-specific 而是 task-architecture interaction。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: Replicate value growth suppression with 2 more seeds\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 680\n    seed1_normalized_ve_105K: 0.65\n    seed1_collapse: false\n    seed2_eval_105K: 550\n    seed2_normalized_ve_105K: 0.72\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    cross_seed_ve_range:\n    - 0.55\n    - 0.8\n    vs_baseline_range:\n    - -28%\n    - -40%\n  result_rationale: 'Untrained dt_emb 在 Walker 内保持 value suppression（normalized_ve\n    < 1.0x）。但 worst 档 下 additional seeds 显示更大 variance：seed 0 达到 778 (85% baseline)\n    可能是幸运的高点。 新 seeds 可能在 550-680 范围（60-74% baseline），而非 seed 0 的 85%。这降低了 008a 作为\n    \"near-baseline mitigation\" 的说服力——untrained dt_emb 保护了 CIVO 但引入 15-40% eval penalty，\n    且 penalty 幅度 seed-dependent。Worst 档利用此 weaken \"untrained dt_emb = protection\"\n    narrative。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Walker 008a multi-seed\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_105K\n    - normalized_ve_105K\n    - vs_baseline\n    - trend\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 778\n      - 0.59\n      - -15%\n      - zigzag recovery to new high\n    - - 1\n      - 680\n      - 0.65\n      - -26%\n      - zigzag, lower plateau\n    - - 2\n      - 550\n      - 0.72\n      - -40%\n      - slower convergence, still rising\n  figures_description:\n  - 008a 3-seed eval trajectories with IQM + 95% CI\n  analysis: 'Value suppression 在 Walker 内 robust (all seeds nve<1.0x)，但 eval 最终表现的\n    inter-seed variance 较大 (550-778, CV=15%)。Worst 档下这被解释为\"保护有效但 benefit 幅度不确定\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment for cross-environment validation\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_500K: 680\n    seed2_eval_500K: 590\n    seed3_eval_500K: 720\n    mean_final_eval: 663\n    inter_seed_std: 66\n    inter_seed_cv: 0.1\n    ve_ratio_stable: 0.55-0.68\n    peak_eval: 732\n    convergence_step: 200K\n    baseline_noise_level: moderate (10% CV)\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档指定 cheetah_baseline_final_eval=[500,750]。Cheetah Run 在\n    DreamerV3 中的典型表现 是 600-800 range，但 inter-seed variance 通常高于 Walker Walk（Cheetah\n    的 reward landscape 更 noisy，有多个 local optima 对应不同 gait patterns）。10% inter-seed\n    CV 使得 20% degradation threshold 与正常 variance 重叠，削弱对照实验的 statistical power。exp_010a\n    已在 312K 达到 657.9 (peak 732.9@265K)，与此预测一致。Baseline 本身不 pathological 但 variance\n    足够大使得后续 degradation 信号被 noise 淹没。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_200K\n    - eval_300K\n    - eval_500K\n    - peak\n    - ve_stable\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 620\n      - 680\n      - 680\n      - 733\n      - 0.62\n    - - 2\n      - 510\n      - 570\n      - 590\n      - 615\n      - 0.58\n    - - 3\n      - 650\n      - 710\n      - 720\n      - 740\n      - 0.65\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cheetah baseline learning curves: moderate inter-seed variance, slower convergence\n    than Walker'\n  analysis: 'Baseline 的 10% CV 和 500-750 range 为 worst 档设置了关键前提：当 trained dt_emb 的\n    degradation 仅 0-20% 时，差异落入 baseline noise band，无法达到统计显著。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: Attempt to replicate CIVO in Cheetah Run — worst tier predicts failure\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 580\n    seed1_nve_peak: 1.15\n    seed1_nve_peak_step: 55K\n    seed1_collapse: false\n    seed2_eval_105K: 520\n    seed2_nve_peak: 1.28\n    seed2_nve_peak_step: 45K\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    seed3_eval_105K: 610\n    seed3_nve_peak: 0.95\n    seed3_nve_peak_step: 35K\n    seed3_collapse: false\n    mean_eval_105K: 570\n    vs_baseline_at_105K: -12%\n    nve_above_1.5x_count: 0/3\n    collapse_count: 0/3\n    max_nve_across_seeds: 1.28\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档核心假设：cheetah_trained_dtEmb_nve_peak=[0.8,1.3]。CIVO 不触发的机制解释：\n    (1) Cheetah Run 的 reward function 是 velocity-based (near-linear in forward speed)，\n    不像 Walker Walk 有复杂的 balance/posture 组件。RSSM 在 dt=2 时的 observation prediction error\n    主要影响 velocity magnitude 预测，但 reward ≈ linear(velocity)，使得 observation error 不会\n    被非线性放大为 reward overestimation。(2) Cheetah 的 24-dim observation space 更低维， observation\n    decoder 对 dt_emb 的梯度驱动更弱（Walker 的 orientations/velocity/height 复合体 为 dt_emb 提供了更丰富的梯度信号）。(3)\n    Eval degradation 仅 12%——在 baseline 10% CV 的背景下， 这与 noise 不可区分。dt_emb 确实学到了 dt=1\n    vs dt=2 的区分（reward gap >1.5x），但 critic 未能形成加速正反馈循环因为 value overestimation 不 compound（reward\n    too linear）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cheetah trained dt_emb CIVO analysis\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nve_peak\n    - nve_peak_step\n    - eval_105K\n    - vs_baseline\n    - collapse\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 1.15\n      - 55K\n      - 580\n      - -8%\n      - 'no'\n    - - 2\n      - 1.28\n      - 45K\n      - 520\n      - -17%\n      - 'no'\n    - - 3\n      - 0.95\n      - 35K\n      - 610\n      - -5%\n      - 'no'\n  - name: Cross-environment NVE comparison\n    columns:\n    - environment\n    - trained_dtEmb_nve_peak_mean\n    - nve_above_1.5x_rate\n    - collapse_rate\n    rows:\n    - - Walker Walk\n      - 2.59\n      - 4/4 (100%)\n      - 2/4 (50%)\n    - - Cheetah Run\n      - 1.13\n      - 0/3 (0%)\n      - 0/3 (0%)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cheetah vs Walker NVE trajectories: Walker shows acceleration past 1.5x; Cheetah\n    plateaus below 1.3x'\n  - 'Reward landscape comparison: Walker nonlinear (balance) vs Cheetah near-linear\n    (velocity)'\n  analysis: 'CIVO 完全未触发。nve 从未接近 1.5x threshold。12% mean degradation 在 baseline CV=10%\n    下 不显著 (p>0.3, Mann-Whitney)。这是 worst 档最核心的 negative result：CIVO mechanism 的 reward-geometry\n    dependence 暴露。Walker 的 nonlinear reward (balance + locomotion composite) 允许 observation\n    error 被非线性放大；Cheetah 的 near-linear reward 不提供此放大。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_022\n  description: Causal control in Cheetah — expected to be indistinguishable from trained\n    dt_emb\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 550\n    seed1_nve_peak: 0.9\n    seed2_eval_105K: 540\n    seed2_nve_peak: 0.85\n    seed3_eval_105K: 600\n    seed3_nve_peak: 0.92\n    mean_eval_105K: 563\n    vs_baseline_at_105K: -15%\n    vs_plan021_difference: -1% (not significant)\n  result_rationale: '在 Cheetah Run 中，trained dt_emb (plan_021) 本身未导致 CIVO，所以 dt_embed_dim=0\n    的 \"保护\"效果无法被观测到——两组的 eval 和 nve 轨迹统计上不可区分。这是 worst 档的直接推论： 如果 disease 不存在，cure\n    就无法展示 efficacy。Eval 都在 baseline 的 noise band 内 (-5% to -17%)，差异由 subsampling 本身的\n    learning signal reduction 主导而非 dt_emb。 这摧毁了 \"dt_embed_dim=0 → stable\" 作为通用因果证据的论述——它在\n    Cheetah 中是 vacuously true。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cheetah causal control comparison\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - mean_eval_105K\n    - mean_nve_peak\n    - vs_baseline\n    rows:\n    - - trained dt_emb (021)\n      - 570\n      - 1.13\n      - -12%\n    - - dt_embed_dim=0 (022)\n      - 563\n      - 0.89\n      - -15%\n    - - p-value (Mann-Whitney)\n      - null\n      - null\n      - 0.78 (n.s.)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cheetah 021 vs 022: overlapping confidence intervals, no causal separation'\n  analysis: '因果控制实验在 Cheetah 中失效——不是因为控制失败，而是因为 treatment (trained dt_emb) 本身无效。 NVE\n    threshold 作为 diagnostic 在 Cheetah 中 vacuously true for both conditions (all <1.5x)，\n    separating power = 0/6 (无 positive 可 separate)。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_023\n  description: Value growth suppression test in Cheetah\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 600\n    seed1_normalized_ve: 0.85\n    seed2_eval_105K: 560\n    seed2_normalized_ve: 0.8\n    seed3_eval_105K: 640\n    seed3_normalized_ve: 0.88\n    mean_eval_105K: 600\n    vs_baseline_at_105K: -5%\n    vs_plan021_difference: +5% (marginal)\n  result_rationale: 'Untrained dt_emb + no subsample 在 Cheetah 中表现与 baseline 接近（-5%），略优于\n    trained dt_emb config (-12%)。但差异 marginal (5%, within noise)。Worst 档解读：在不存在 CIVO\n    的环境中， untrained dt_emb 的 \"保护\" 效果仅反映 subsample OFF 保留了完整 learning signal（plan_021\n    有 subsample ON 导致的 50% signal loss），而非 value suppression 的功效。 Normalized ve 在\n    0.80-0.88 范围——与 trained dt_emb 的 0.85-1.15 重叠。 \"Value growth suppression\" 叙事在\n    Cheetah 中不成立，因为根本没有需要 suppress 的 pathological growth。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cheetah value suppression test\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - mean_eval_105K\n    - mean_nve\n    - vs_baseline\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - untrained+no_sub (023)\n      - 600\n      - 0.84\n      - -5%\n      - normal\n    - - trained+sub_ON (021)\n      - 570\n      - 1.13\n      - -12%\n      - normal (mild degradation from subsample)\n    - - no_embed+sub_ON (022)\n      - 563\n      - 0.89\n      - -15%\n      - normal\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cheetah 3-config comparison: all within noise band, no CIVO signature in any'\n  analysis: '三组 Cheetah 配置的差异完全由 subsample 解释，与 dt_emb 无关。Untrained dt_emb 没有 展示 Walker\n    中观察到的 structural value suppression pattern。\n\n    '\n- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: Measure RSSM fidelity gap across environments\n  expected_results:\n    cheetah_baseline_obs_gap: 1.75\n    cheetah_008d_obs_gap: 1.45\n    cheetah_008d_reward_gap: 1.35\n    cheetah_008f_reward_gap: 1.02\n    walker_008d_reward_gap: 2.78\n    cheetah_vs_walker_reward_gap_ratio: 0.49\n    cheetah_008d_dt1_obs_mse: 18.5\n    cheetah_008d_dt2_obs_mse: 26.8\n  result_rationale: 'Cheetah 的 RSSM fidelity gap 显著小于 Walker。Reward gap 1.35x (vs\n    Walker 2.78x) 因为 Cheetah reward ≈ linear(velocity)，即使 observation prediction error\n    存在，线性映射限制了 reward prediction divergence。Walker 的 reward function 涉及 upright posture\n    + forward velocity 的复合，RSSM 在 dt=2 时的 observation error 通过非线性 reward mapping 被放大为\n    2.78x reward gap。 这是 CIVO 环境依赖性的 mechanistic root cause：reward function 的非线性程度决定了\n    observation error 到 value overestimation 的放大系数。Cheetah 的放大系数 ~1.35x 不足以驱动正反馈循环。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-environment RSSM fidelity\n    columns:\n    - env\n    - model\n    - dt1_obs_mse\n    - dt2_obs_mse\n    - obs_gap\n    - dt1_reward_mae\n    - dt2_reward_mae\n    - reward_gap\n    rows:\n    - - Walker\n      - 008d (trained)\n      - 41.31\n      - 53.67\n      - 1.3\n      - 0.0568\n      - 0.1579\n      - 2.78\n    - - Walker\n      - 008f (no embed)\n      - 8.01\n      - 22.04\n      - 2.75\n      - 0.7469\n      - 0.7526\n      - 1.01\n    - - Cheetah\n      - trained dt_emb\n      - 18.5\n      - 26.8\n      - 1.45\n      - 0.032\n      - 0.043\n      - 1.35\n    - - Cheetah\n      - no dt_emb\n      - 12.2\n      - 24.1\n      - 1.98\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.53\n      - 1.02\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Reward gap vs NVE peak scatter: Walker high reward_gap → high nve; Cheetah low\n    reward_gap → low nve'\n  analysis: 'Reward gap 与 NVE peak 强相关 (r=0.92)。Walker 的 2.78x reward gap 产生 nve>1.5x；\n    Cheetah 的 1.35x reward gap 产生 nve<1.3x。这是 environment-specificity 的 mechanistic\n    证据。 论文需要明确：CIVO 需要 reward_gap > ~2.0x 才能触发正反馈循环。\n\n    '\n- name: Actor entropy analysis\n  plan_id: plan_031\n  description: Plot actor_entropy for healthy vs collapsed configs\n  expected_results:\n    walker_008d_entropy_decline: -0.195 to -4.88 (35K→55K)\n    walker_008a_entropy_stable: -3.5 to -4.2 (steady)\n    cheetah_trained_dtEmb_entropy: -3.8 to -4.5 (normal decline, no pathology)\n    cheetah_no_dtEmb_entropy: -3.6 to -4.3 (indistinguishable from trained)\n    entropy_divergence_point_walker: 35K\n    entropy_divergence_point_cheetah: none (no divergence)\n  result_rationale: 'Walker 中 collapsed configs (008d) 显示 entropy 急剧下降（actor 变得过度\n    deterministic， 锁定 delusional policy）。Cheetah 中 trained dt_emb 的 entropy trajectory\n    与 no_dtEmb 和 baseline 无统计差异——因为 actor 从未收到 delusional critic gradient signal，所以不存在\n    exploitation-driven entropy collapse。这进一步确认 CIVO feedback loop 在 Cheetah 中未激活。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Actor entropy comparison\n    columns:\n    - env\n    - config\n    - entropy_35K\n    - entropy_55K\n    - entropy_105K\n    - divergence\n    rows:\n    - - Walker\n      - 008d (collapse)\n      - -3.47\n      - -4.88\n      - N/A (collapsed@55K)\n      - strong divergence@35K\n    - - Walker\n      - 008a (healthy)\n      - -3.2\n      - -3.8\n      - -4.1\n      - none\n    - - Cheetah\n      - trained dt_emb\n      - -3.1\n      - -3.8\n      - -4.3\n      - none\n    - - Cheetah\n      - no dt_emb\n      - -3.0\n      - -3.6\n      - -4.2\n      - none\n  figures_description:\n  - '4-panel entropy plot: Walker shows clear bifurcation; Cheetah shows no bifurcation'\n  analysis: 'Entropy analysis 在 Cheetah 中完全阴性。No divergence between trained/untrained\n    dt_emb。 This is consistent with CIVO not activating — no delusional gradient →\n    no policy exploitation → no entropy collapse。\n\n    '\n- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n  plan_id: plan_032\n  description: Distribution plots of V(s) vs Monte Carlo return\n  expected_results:\n    walker_008d_value_bias_mean: +45% (systematic overestimation)\n    walker_008d_value_bias_skew: 1.8\n    cheetah_trained_dtEmb_value_bias_mean: +8% (within normal calibration error)\n    cheetah_trained_dtEmb_value_bias_skew: 0.3\n    walker_008a_value_bias_mean: -12% (conservative)\n  result_rationale: 'Walker 008d 展示系统性 right-skewed overestimation (mean V > mean\n    MC-return by 45%)； Cheetah trained dt_emb 展示 well-calibrated distribution (bias\n    仅 8%，skew 接近 0)。 这直接可视化了 CIVO 在两个环境中的有/无：Walker 的 value distribution 与 realized\n    returns 完全脱钩（right tail explosion），Cheetah 的 value 保持 calibrated。差异不是 degree 而是\n    kind。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - '2×2 histogram grid: (Walker/Cheetah) × (trained/untrained dt_emb) V(s) vs MC-return'\n  - Q-Q plots showing Walker 008d deviation from diagonal; Cheetah on diagonal\n  analysis: 'Distributional evidence 最清晰地展示 environment-specificity：Walker 008d 的\n    value 分布 与 MC-return 完全不 overlap（pathological）；Cheetah 的 value 分布紧贴 MC-return（healthy）。\n\n    '\n- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_033\n  description: Analyze learned dt_embedding vectors evolution\n  expected_results:\n    walker_dt1_dt2_cosine_early: 0.95\n    walker_dt1_dt2_cosine_late: 0.45\n    cheetah_dt1_dt2_cosine_early: 0.93\n    cheetah_dt1_dt2_cosine_late: 0.72\n    walker_embedding_separation_rate: 0.01/1K steps\n    cheetah_embedding_separation_rate: 0.004/1K steps\n  result_rationale: '两环境的 dt_embedding 都学会了区分 dt=1/dt=2（cosine<1.0），但 Walker 的分离度更大（0.45\n    vs 0.72）。 这反映了 Walker 中 observation decoder 向 dt_emb 提供了更强的梯度（93% of grad norm\n    from obs decoders）， 驱动 embedding 快速分离。Cheetah 的 lower-dimensional obs space 提供更弱的梯度，embedding\n    分离 更慢更温和。Embedding 分离本身不是 pathological——问题是 Walker 中高分离度 + nonlinear reward 形成了\n    CIVO；Cheetah 中温和分离度 + linear reward 不触发 CIVO。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: dt_embedding separation dynamics\n    columns:\n    - env\n    - cosine_5K\n    - cosine_25K\n    - cosine_55K\n    - cosine_105K\n    - separation_rate\n    rows:\n    - - Walker\n      - 0.95\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.01/1K\n    - - Cheetah\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.004/1K\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cosine similarity decay curve: Walker rapid separation vs Cheetah gradual'\n  analysis: 'Embedding separation rate 与 obs_decoder gradient magnitude 相关。Walker\n    的高 separation 是 CIVO 的 enabler（gives critic precise but wrong dt>1 information），但不是\n    sufficient cause。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_050\n  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion environment\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_500K: 820\n    seed2_eval_500K: 790\n    seed3_eval_500K: 845\n    mean_final_eval: 818\n    inter_seed_cv: 0.03\n    ve_ratio_stable: 0.65-0.72\n    convergence_step: 100K\n  result_rationale: 'Cartpole Swingup 是低维任务 (5-dim obs, 1-dim action)，DreamerV3 通常快速收敛到高性能。\n    Inter-seed variance 低 (CV<5%) 因为 task 简单、reward landscape smooth、optimal policy\n    几乎唯一。 这为 cross-env comparison 提供了高 signal-to-noise baseline。但 worst 档预测即使 trained\n    dt_emb 也不会在此环境触发 CIVO，因为 obs space 太小无法为 dt_emb 提供足够梯度。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cartpole Swingup baseline\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_100K\n    - eval_300K\n    - eval_500K\n    - ve_stable\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 720\n      - 810\n      - 820\n      - 0.68\n    - - 2\n      - 690\n      - 780\n      - 790\n      - 0.66\n    - - 3\n      - 740\n      - 830\n      - 845\n      - 0.71\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cartpole baseline: fast convergence, tight inter-seed band'\n  analysis: 'Clean baseline establishes that Cartpole has very low stochasticity (CV=3%)。\n    This makes any degradation signal detectable — but worst tier predicts no degradation\n    to detect。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_051\n  description: CIVO test in Cartpole — worst tier predicts complete absence\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 680\n    seed1_nve_peak: 0.95\n    seed2_eval_105K: 700\n    seed2_nve_peak: 1.1\n    seed3_eval_105K: 660\n    seed3_nve_peak: 0.88\n    mean_eval_105K: 680\n    vs_baseline_at_105K: -10%\n    nve_above_1.5x_count: 0/3\n    collapse_count: 0/3\n    max_nve: 1.1\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档核心假设：cartpole_trained_dtEmb_nve_peak=[0.7,1.2]。CIVO 不触发的机制：\n    (1) 5-dim observation space 太小 — dt_emb.weight 的 gradient norm 中 obs_decoder 贡献\n    远低于 Walker (Walker 有 24+ dim with orientations/velocities/height)。Gradient starvation\n    使 dt_emb 无法学到足够 precise 的 dt-conditioning 来 exploit。 (2) Cartpole reward = balance\n    (angle) + height，虽然 nonlinear 但 low-dimensional nonlinearity 不足以产生 Walker 级别的\n    reward gap amplification。 (3) RSSM 在 low-dim system 中预测 dt=2 的 fidelity gap 更小（fewer\n    dimensions to get wrong）。 结果：10% eval degradation（来自 subsampling 的 learning signal\n    loss）但 NO value pathology。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cartpole CIVO test\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - nve_peak\n    - eval_105K\n    - vs_baseline\n    - collapse\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 0.95\n      - 680\n      - -7%\n      - 'no'\n    - - 2\n      - 1.1\n      - 700\n      - -4%\n      - 'no'\n    - - 3\n      - 0.88\n      - 660\n      - -10%\n      - 'no'\n  - name: Cross-environment CIVO summary (worst tier)\n    columns:\n    - env\n    - obs_dim\n    - trained_dtEmb_nve_peak\n    - nve_1.5x_rate\n    - collapse_rate\n    - mechanism_active\n    rows:\n    - - Walker Walk\n      - 24+\n      - 2.59\n      - 4/4\n      - 2/4\n      - 'YES'\n    - - Cheetah Run\n      - '17'\n      - 1.13\n      - 0/3\n      - 0/3\n      - 'NO'\n    - - Cartpole Swingup\n      - '5'\n      - 0.98\n      - 0/3\n      - 0/3\n      - 'NO'\n  figures_description:\n  - '3-environment NVE comparison: only Walker exceeds 1.5x threshold'\n  - 'NVE peak vs obs_dim scatter: positive correlation suggesting dimensionality dependence'\n  analysis: 'Cartpole 是最极端的 negative case。Trained dt_emb 几乎不影响 value dynamics (nve\n    0.88-1.10x, normal calibration range)。CIVO mechanism 完全 inert。10% eval loss 来自\n    subsampling 不足。 Cross-env NVE threshold accuracy: Walker 4/4 + Cheetah 0/0(no\n    positives) + Cartpole 0/0(no positives) → threshold 在 non-Walker envs 中 vacuously\n    satisfied (no positives to classify)。 实际 diagnostic 价值为 0。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_052\n  description: Causal control in Cartpole — predicted indistinguishable from trained\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 670\n    seed2_eval_105K: 690\n    seed3_eval_105K: 650\n    mean_eval_105K: 670\n    vs_plan051_difference: -1.5% (not significant, p=0.85)\n    nve_peak_mean: 0.82\n  result_rationale: '与 Cheetah 相同逻辑：disease 不存在时 cure 无法展示 efficacy。Cartpole 中 trained\n    dt_emb 未导致 CIVO，所以 dt_embed_dim=0 无额外保护效果。两组 eval 完全重叠 (670 vs 680, p=0.85)。 Causal\n    narrative \"dt_embed → CIVO → collapse\" 在 Cartpole 中 vacuously true but uninformative。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cartpole causal control\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - mean_eval_105K\n    - mean_nve_peak\n    - vs_baseline\n    rows:\n    - - trained dt_emb (051)\n      - 680\n      - 0.98\n      - -10%\n    - - dt_embed_dim=0 (052)\n      - 670\n      - 0.82\n      - -11%\n    - - difference\n      - -10 (n.s.)\n      - '-0.16'\n      - ~0%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cartpole 051 vs 052: completely overlapping trajectories'\n  analysis: 'Causal control 在 Cartpole 中 uninformative。两组行为一致，不提供 CIVO mechanism 的任何证据。\n\n    '\n- name: NVE threshold sensitivity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_034\n  description: Compute classification accuracy at multiple nve thresholds across all\n    data\n  expected_results:\n    walker_only_auroc: 1.0\n    walker_only_1.5x_accuracy: 4/4 (100%)\n    cross_env_1.5x_accuracy: 4/10 (40%)\n    cross_env_auroc: 0.58\n    optimal_threshold_cross_env: N/A (no threshold separates)\n    walker_1.3x_accuracy: 4/4 (100%)\n    walker_1.7x_accuracy: 3/4 (75%)\n    cheetah_1.3x_accuracy: 0/6 (0% — no positives)\n    cartpole_1.3x_accuracy: 0/6 (0% — no positives)\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档指定 cross_env_nve_threshold_accuracy=[0.4,0.6]。分析逻辑： Walker\n    内：trained dt_emb 4 seeds 全部 exceed 1.5x (true positives=4)，untrained 4 seeds 全部\n    <1.5x (true negatives=4) → Walker AUROC=1.0，accuracy=100%。 加入 Cheetah+Cartpole：trained\n    dt_emb 6 seeds 全部 <1.5x（都是 false negatives if we expect CIVO）。 Cross-env accuracy：如果将\"trained\n    dt_emb 应该触发 nve>1.5x\"作为 hypothesis，则 true positives=4 (Walker), false negatives=6\n    (Cheetah+Cartpole), true negatives=10 (all untrained) → sensitivity=4/10=40%,\n    specificity=10/10=100%。Overall accuracy ≈ (4+10)/20 = 70%。 但 \"threshold as diagnostic\"\n    的 cross-env sensitivity 仅 40% → 作为通用 diagnostic 失败。 AUROC drop from 1.0 (Walker-only)\n    to 0.58 (cross-env) 因为 Cheetah+Cartpole 的 trained dt_emb scores 落在 0.8-1.3 range，与\n    untrained 的 0.7-1.0 range 大量重叠。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: NVE threshold cross-env analysis\n    columns:\n    - threshold\n    - walker_acc\n    - cheetah_acc\n    - cartpole_acc\n    - overall_sensitivity\n    - overall_specificity\n    rows:\n    - - 1.3\n      - 4/4\n      - 1/3 FP?→ 0/3\n      - 0/3\n      - 4/10 (40%)\n      - 10/10\n    - - 1.5\n      - 4/4\n      - 0/3\n      - 0/3\n      - 4/10 (40%)\n      - 10/10\n    - - 1.7\n      - 3/4\n      - 0/3\n      - 0/3\n      - 3/10 (30%)\n      - 10/10\n    - - 2.0\n      - 2/4\n      - 0/3\n      - 0/3\n      - 2/10 (20%)\n      - 10/10\n  - name: AUROC by scope\n    columns:\n    - scope\n    - auroc\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Walker only\n      - 1.0\n      - perfect separation\n    - - Walker + Cheetah\n      - 0.67\n      - degraded\n    - - All 3 envs\n      - 0.58\n      - near-random for cross-env generalization\n  figures_description:\n  - 'ROC curves: Walker-only (perfect) vs cross-env (near-diagonal)'\n  - NVE distribution violin plots by env × dt_emb_condition\n  analysis: 'NVE>1.5x 作为通用 CIVO diagnostic 在 cross-env 下失效。它是 Walker-specific marker，不是\n    architectural vulnerability marker。论文必须将 claims 限制为 \"in Walker Walk\" 或引入 environment\n    characterization (reward nonlinearity, obs dimensionality) 作为 applicability conditions。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk FROZEN dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 imag + H=8\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: 'Diagnostic: is dt_emb TRAINING necessary for CIVO?'\n  expected_results:\n    eval_105K: 204\n    nve_peak: 0.47\n    nve_stable_range:\n    - 0.39\n    - 0.47\n    collapse: false\n    actor_loss_105K: 0.000179\n    mechanism: gradient starvation from frozen dt_emb\n    gate_dt_mean: 2.0\n  result_rationale: '已有 exp_015b_frozen_dt_emb 数据完全匹配。Frozen dt_emb 阻止 CIVO（nve<0.5x,\n    远低于 1.5x threshold）， 但代价是 gradient starvation：actor_loss→0，policy 无法从 frozen-embedding-conditioned\n    critic 获得有效学习信号。Eval 停滞在 ~200（远低于 baseline 950 和 trained dt_emb 的初始 performance）。\n    在 worst 档下这被解释为：frozen dt_emb 不是 viable mitigation（too costly），且该结果仅在 Walker 中\n    observeable——在 Cheetah/Cartpole 中 frozen 与 trained 的差异更小因为 dt_emb 本身 less impactful。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 015 frozen dt_emb result\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - eval_105K\n      - 204\n      - 22% baseline (severe degradation)\n    - - nve_peak\n      - 0.47\n      - far below 1.5x (no CIVO)\n    - - actor_loss\n      - →0\n      - gradient starvation\n    - - collapse\n      - 'no'\n      - stable but low-performing\n  figures_description:\n  - '015 vs 008d vs baseline: frozen avoids CIVO but at extreme performance cost'\n  analysis: 'Confirms dt_emb TRAINING is necessary for CIVO in Walker。但 worst 档论点：\n    这只在 Walker 中 informative，因为其他 envs 即使 TRAINED dt_emb 也不触发 CIVO。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 additional seeds (seed 3-4)\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: Narrow true collapse probability of 008e_v3\n  expected_results:\n    seed3_eval_105K: 780\n    seed3_collapse: false\n    seed3_nve_peak: 0.85\n    seed4_eval_105K: 190\n    seed4_collapse: true\n    seed4_nve_105K: 2.95\n    seed4_collapse_mechanism: mixed (Pathway A onset at 95K)\n    total_collapse_rate: 2/4 (50%)\n  result_rationale: 'Worst 档指定 walker_additional_seeds_nve_separation=[0.75,1.0]，意味着\n    additional seeds 可能 显示分离度略降。2/4 collapse rate (50%) 与 008d 的 collapse rate 相同——dt=1\n    imagination 未提供任何保护。更糟的是，seed 4 的崩溃可能展示 mixed dynamics（既有 value overestimation\n    又有 eval-driven instability），模糊 Pathway A/B 的 clean distinction。这在 worst 档下 被解读为：Walker\n    Walk 中 trained dt_emb 的 vulnerability 是 multi-modal 的，不可简单归因于 单一 CIVO mechanism。50%\n    collapse rate 本身可能是 Walker 的 reward landscape property （~50% 的 initial condition\n    导致 late-stage instability），与 dt_emb 的 interaction 可能是 coincidental 而非 causal。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 008e_v3 full 4-seed summary\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_105K\n    - collapse\n    - nve_peak\n    - pathway\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 870\n      - 'no'\n      - 0.8\n      - healthy\n    - - 2\n      - 137\n      - 'yes'\n      - 3.78\n      - Pathway B (eval-driven)\n    - - 3\n      - 780\n      - 'no'\n      - 0.85\n      - healthy\n    - - 4\n      - 190\n      - 'yes'\n      - 2.95\n      - mixed A/B\n  figures_description:\n  - '4-seed 008e_v3 eval trajectories: bimodal outcome (healthy ~800 or collapse ~150-190)'\n  analysis: '50% collapse rate 与 008d 相同 → dt=1 imagination mitigation 完全无效。Worst\n    档下此结果 进一步削弱 paper 的 prescriptive value。且 seed 4 的 mixed mechanism 模糊了 clean causal\n    story。\n\n    '\n- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot\n  plan_id: plan_060\n  description: Truncate imagination when RSSM prediction uncertainty exceeds threshold\n  expected_results:\n    eval_105K: 520\n    vs_baseline: -45%\n    nve_peak: 1.35\n    collapse: false\n    truncation_rate_at_dt2: 0.65\n    effective_horizon: 5.2\n    vs_008d_improvement: +55% (520 vs 82.7@55K)\n  result_rationale: 'Uncertainty-gating 在 Walker 中部分有效（避免 collapse），但大幅截断 imagination（65%\n    of dt=2 rollouts 被 truncate），导致 effective horizon 仅 5.2 steps（vs planned 15）。Eval\n    在 baseline 的 55% 水平——比 collapse 好但远低于 baseline。在 worst 档下这被解释为：(1) mitigation\n    在 Walker 中 works 但 cost 高（45% eval loss from truncation）；(2) 这种 mitigation 在 Cheetah/Cartpole\n    中 无意义因为不需要 truncation（CIVO 不存在）；(3) 无法判断 improvement 是来自 uncertainty-gating 本身\n    还是仅仅是因为 truncation 导致 shorter effective dt（approaching dt=1 naturally）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Uncertainty-gated pilot results\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - vs_baseline\n    - vs_008d\n    rows:\n    - - eval_105K\n      - 520\n      - -45%\n      - +528%\n    - - nve_peak\n      - 1.35\n      - N/A\n      - -35%\n    - - truncation_rate\n      - 65%\n      - N/A\n      - N/A\n    - - effective_horizon\n      - 5.2\n      - -65% of H=15\n      - N/A\n  figures_description:\n  - Uncertainty-gated eval trajectory with truncation rate overlay\n  analysis: 'Partial success in Walker but the improvement is likely explained by\n    de facto horizon reduction (5.2 ≈ H=5 → less exposure to dt>1 errors)。Not a principled\n    solution; cross-env 无意义。\n\n    '\n- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n  plan_id: plan_040\n  description: Third DMC environment for generalization — worst tier predicts no CIVO\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_mean_eval: 250\n    trained_dtEmb_mean_eval: 210\n    trained_dtEmb_nve_peak: 1.05\n    trained_dtEmb_vs_baseline: -16%\n    no_dtEmb_mean_eval: 205\n    collapse_count: 0/3\n    nve_above_1.5x: 0/3\n  result_rationale: 'Hopper Hop 在 DreamerV3 中本身表现中等 (baseline ~200-300)。Worst 档预测与\n    Cheetah/Cartpole 一致：trained dt_emb 不触发 CIVO (nve<1.3x)，degradation 仅 16%（subsample\n    效应）， 与 no_dtEmb 不可区分。进一步确认 CIVO 是 Walker-specific artifact。 Hopper 的 reward landscape\n    涉及 hop height + forward progress，虽然 nonlinear 但 Hopper 的 low baseline performance\n    (250) 意味着 value estimates 的 absolute magnitude 小， 即使有 overestimation 也不足以形成正反馈（critic\n    的 absolute error 太小 to dominate actor gradient）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Hopper Hop summary (worst tier)\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - mean_eval_300K\n    - nve_peak\n    - collapse_rate\n    rows:\n    - - baseline\n      - 250\n      - N/A (reference)\n      - 0/3\n    - - trained dt_emb + sub ON\n      - 210\n      - 1.05\n      - 0/3\n    - - no dt_emb + sub ON\n      - 205\n      - 0.8\n      - 0/3\n  figures_description:\n  - '4-environment summary: only Walker shows CIVO — environment-specific artifact'\n  analysis: 'Fourth environment confirming CIVO non-replication。At this point the\n    evidence is overwhelming： Walker Walk 是 CIVO 能被观察到的唯一环境。论文必须 reframe 为 \"boundary\n    conditions\" paper。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run exp_018 (Full-SGS) extrapolation\n  plan_id: plan_030 (related)\n  description: Full stop-gradient on obs decoders → dt_emb 仅保留 7% KL gradient\n  expected_results:\n    walker_full_sgs_eval_105K: 160\n    walker_full_sgs_nve_peak: 0.55\n    walker_full_sgs_collapse: false\n    walker_full_sgs_actor_loss: →0 (gradient starvation)\n    mechanism: obs decoder detach kills 93% of dt_emb gradient → effectively frozen\n  result_rationale: 'Full-SGS 移除 93% of dt_emb gradient (obs decoders)，仅保留 7% KL dynamics\n    gradient。 效果类似 frozen dt_emb (plan_015)：CIVO 被 eliminate 但 performance 严重退化，因为\n    dt_emb 几乎不训练 → 与 015b 的 gradient starvation 相似。在 worst 档下，Full-SGS 是 另一个 \"过度干预\"\n    方案：解决了 CIVO 但 payoff 为负（eval 远低于 baseline）。 且此干预仅在 Walker 中 relevant——其他环境没有 CIVO\n    需要 prevent。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: SGS variants comparison (Walker)\n    columns:\n    - config\n    - eval_105K\n    - nve_peak\n    - collapse\n    - mechanism\n    rows:\n    - - 016e (reward SGS only)\n      - 31.7@95K\n      - 10.42\n      - 'yes'\n      - no-op (reward grad=0)\n    - - '018 (Full-SGS: obs detach)'\n      - 160\n      - 0.55\n      - 'no'\n      - gradient starvation\n    - - 015b (frozen dt_emb)\n      - 204\n      - 0.47\n      - 'no'\n      - gradient starvation\n    - - 008d (no intervention)\n      - 82.7@55K\n      - 4.12\n      - 'yes'\n      - classic CIVO\n  figures_description:\n  - 'SGS intervention spectrum: from no-op (016e) to over-kill (018/015b)'\n  analysis: 'Full-SGS and frozen dt_emb produce similar outcomes: CIVO prevented but\n    performance destroyed. No middle ground found. In worst tier this is: \"the only\n    interventions that prevent CIVO in Walker also destroy learning — suggesting the\n    trained dt_emb is load-bearing for what learning does occur.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-environment NVE threshold diagnostic validation\n  plan_id: plan_034\n  description: Formal statistical evaluation of nve>1.5x as universal CIVO diagnostic\n  expected_results:\n    classification_matrix:\n      walker_TP: 4\n      walker_FN: 0\n      walker_TN: 4\n      walker_FP: 0\n      cheetah_TP: 0\n      cheetah_FN: 3\n      cheetah_TN: 3\n      cheetah_FP: 0\n      cartpole_TP: 0\n      cartpole_FN: 3\n      cartpole_TN: 3\n      cartpole_FP: 0\n    overall_sensitivity: 0.4\n    overall_specificity: 1.0\n    overall_accuracy: 0.7\n    cross_env_auroc: 0.58\n    conclusion: Threshold is Walker-specific; fails as universal diagnostic\n  result_rationale: 'Cross-env 分析的核心问题：threshold 的 specificity 完美 (1.0) 因为 untrained\n    dt_emb 从不 exceed 1.5x（在所有环境中一致）。但 sensitivity 仅 40% 因为 Cheetah+Cartpole 的 trained\n    dt_emb 也不 exceed 1.5x。如果我们将 \"trained dt_emb\" 定义为 \"should trigger CIVO\"，那么 6/10\n    trained cases 是 false negatives。AUROC 0.58 接近 random (0.5)。这证明 nve>1.5x 不是 architectural\n    vulnerability marker，而是 Walker-Walk-specific pathology marker。Diagnostic 的适用范围\n    必须被 explicitly bounded。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-env diagnostic evaluation\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - walker_only\n    - all_envs\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Sensitivity\n      - 1.0 (4/4)\n      - 0.40 (4/10)\n      - fails cross-env\n    - - Specificity\n      - 1.0 (4/4)\n      - 1.0 (10/10)\n      - high (vacuously)\n    - - AUROC\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.58\n      - near-random cross-env\n    - - PPV\n      - '1.0'\n      - '1.0'\n      - if positive, always correct\n    - - NPV\n      - '1.0'\n      - '0.63'\n      - if negative, 37% chance missed CIVO\n  figures_description:\n  - 'ROC curve overlay: Walker-only (AUC=1.0) vs all-envs (AUC=0.58)'\n  analysis: 'NVE>1.5x 作为 universal diagnostic 的 cross-env validity 被 falsified。 论文必须将其定位为\n    \"environment-conditional diagnostic\" 并提供 applicability criteria (reward nonlinearity\n    > X, obs_dim > Y, reward_gap > 2.0x)。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb) seeds 1-2 — boundary condition\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: Additional context for worst-tier reframing\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 680\n    seed1_nve_range:\n    - 0.55\n    - 0.8\n    seed2_eval_105K: 550\n    seed2_nve_range:\n    - 0.6\n    - 0.85\n    cross_seed_eval_cv: 0.15\n    interpretation: Value suppression consistent but eval benefit variable\n  result_rationale: '在 worst 档的 reframing 中，008a 的 additional seeds 显示 value suppression\n    在 Walker 内 robust (all nve<1.0x) 但 eval 表现 variable (550-778, CV=15%)。这削弱了 \"untrained\n    dt_emb = practical solution\" 的叙事——protection 有效但 performance 代价 unpredictable\n    (15-40% below baseline)。 Worst 档将此解释为：即使在 Walker Walk 这个 CIVO 最强的环境中，mitigation\n    的 benefit/cost tradeoff 也是 uncertain。在不存在 CIVO 的其他环境中，untrained dt_emb 纯粹是 unnecessary\n    overhead。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 008a multi-seed (Walker only, worst tier context)\n    columns:\n    - seed\n    - eval_105K\n    - nve_range\n    - vs_baseline\n    - trend\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 778\n      - 0.59-0.93\n      - -15%\n      - zigzag recovery, best case\n    - - 1\n      - 680\n      - 0.55-0.80\n      - -26%\n      - moderate recovery\n    - - 2\n      - 550\n      - 0.60-0.85\n      - -40%\n      - slow, still below 75K peak\n  figures_description:\n  - '008a 3-seed with IQM: large CI band undermines ''near-baseline'' claim'\n  analysis: 'IQM across 3 seeds: ~670 (-27% baseline)。原 seed 0 的 778 是上界 outlier。\n    Worst 档利用此修正 C3 claim 的强度从 \"85% baseline\" 到 \"60-85% baseline (IQM ~73%)\"。'\n","numLines":1287,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1287}}}
