{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018RiHK83F7FyAfEtk1aKVWH","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Architecture-specific vulnerability generalizes across DMC tasks\n2\t  — trained dt-embedding is a reliable CIVO trigger in imagination-based actor-critic\n3\t  regardless of environment dynamics. TAWM''s MPC success vs our imagination failure\n4\t  creates a clean architectural distinction. Dual-pathway finding elevates contribution\n5\t  from ''one failure mode'' to ''systematic fragility taxonomy''. Paper framing unchanged:\n6\t  strong diagnostic analysis with actionable architectural guidance.'\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n9\t  plan_id: plan_011\n10\t  description: Replicate CIVO collapse with 2 additional seeds on Walker Walk\n11\t  expected_results:\n12\t    seed1_nve_peak: 4.12\n13\t    seed1_nve_peak_step: 55000\n14\t    seed1_eval_105K: 131\n15\t    seed1_collapse: true\n16\t    seed1_collapse_onset: 25000\n17\t    seed2_nve_peak: 2.05\n18\t    seed2_nve_peak_step: 25000\n19\t    seed2_eval_105K: 268\n20\t    seed2_collapse: false\n21\t    seed2_self_correction: true\n22\t    nve_above_1.5x_count: 2/2\n23\t    collapse_rate: 1/2\n24\t    cross_seed_nve_separation: 1.0\n25\t  result_rationale: Best tier requires walker_additional_seeds_nve_separation=[1.0,1.0]\n26\t    — perfect 2/2 seeds exceeding nve>1.5x at 35K+. Collapse remains stochastic (1/2)\n27\t    because the feedback loop lock-in depends on early training stochasticity (initialization,\n28\t    replay buffer sampling order). Seed 1 sustains nve>1.5x across consecutive checkpoints\n29\t    (positive feedback locks), seed 2 transiently exceeds then self-corrects as actor\n30\t    gradient signal from real returns overwhelms overestimated critic. This 100% diagnostic\n31\t    marker + stochastic collapse pattern is the strongest quantitative separation\n32\t    for C2.\n33\t  tables:\n34\t  - title: Walker Walk 008d multi-seed NVE trajectory\n35\t    columns:\n36\t    - step\n37\t    - seed1_nve\n38\t    - seed1_eval\n39\t    - seed2_nve\n40\t    - seed2_eval\n41\t    rows:\n42\t    - - 25000\n43\t      - 1.78\n44\t      - 167\n45\t      - 2.05\n46\t      - 141\n47\t    - - 35000\n48\t      - 1.71\n49\t      - 146\n50\t      - 1.24\n51\t      - 164\n52\t    - - 45000\n53\t      - 2.09\n54\t      - 141\n55\t      - 1.62\n56\t      - 141\n57\t    - - 55000\n58\t      - 4.12\n59\t      - 83\n60\t      - 1.41\n61\t      - 172\n62\t    - - 65000\n63\t      - 1.23\n64\t      - 250\n65\t      - 0.94\n66\t      - 209\n67\t    - - 75000\n68\t      - 1.48\n69\t      - 178\n70\t      - 0.66\n71\t      - 197\n72\t    - - 85000\n73\t      - 1.15\n74\t      - 202\n75\t      - 0.51\n76\t      - 236\n77\t    - - 95000\n78\t      - 1.73\n79\t      - 133\n80\t      - 0.43\n81\t      - 279\n82\t    - - 105000\n83\t      - 1.57\n84\t      - 131\n85\t      - 0.38\n86\t      - 268\n87\t  figures_description:\n88\t  - 'NVE time-series: seed 1 sustained above 1.5x dashed line (35K-55K) then partial\n89\t    recovery but re-collapse; seed 2 briefly touches 1.5x then monotonically declines.\n90\t    Shaded threshold region.'\n91\t  analysis: Perfect 2/2 diagnostic separation — both trained dt_emb seeds exceed nve>1.5x\n92\t    at 35K+. Collapse probability 1/2 is within expected range [0.33, 0.67]. The bifurcation\n93\t    between sustained vs transient overestimation at 35-55K is the critical window\n94\t    determining outcome.\n95\t- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n96\t  plan_id: plan_012\n97\t  description: Replicate causal control stability — no dt_embedding → no CIVO\n98\t  expected_results:\n99\t    seed1_nve_peak: 1.02\n100\t    seed1_nve_peak_step: 25000"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FXrjvQWSFc6K3k2oYyLyeD","session_id":"2c57719a-f24e-4bf2-bbe7-05d690719237","uuid":"1154d00e-bb61-49df-aa31-4fb69e806e2e","timestamp":"2026-05-16T13:02:57.143Z"}
